INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('ar4mirez/samuel/cuda-guide', 'cuda-guide', 'ar4mirez', 'samuel', 'community', 'cuda-guide ar4mirez samuel community The cuda-guide skill provides a minimalist yet powerful AI-assisted development framework for GPU computing, deep learning, and scientific computing. It benefits developers working with CUDA 11+, TypeScript, Python, Go, and Rust. CUDA Guide 是一个用于并行计算和内存优化的开发框架，提供 Minimalist 且强大的 AI 辅助开发功能 CUDA Guide は、パラレルプログラミングとメモリ最適化のための開発フレームワークで、最小限の強力な AI エージェント機能を提供します CUDA Guide 는 병렬 컴퓨팅과 메모리 최적화를 위한 개발 프레임워크로 최소한의 강력한 AI 에이전트 기능을 제공합니다 Nuestra guía de CUDA proporciona un framework de desarrollo asistido por AI para producción, con 35+ guardrails y metodología 4D para TypeScript, Python, Go y Rust Notre guide CUDA offre un framework de développement assisté par l''IA pour la production, avec 35+ garde-fous et une méthodologie 4D pour TypeScript, Python, Go et Rust Unsere CUDA-Anleitung bietet ein AI-gestütztes Entwicklungsframework für die Produktion, mit 35+ Schutzvorkehrungen und 4D-Methode für TypeScript, Python, Go und Rust O guia de CUDA é um framework de desenvolvimento de AI minimalista, mas poderoso, com 35+ guardrails e suporte a linguagens como TypeScript, Python, Go e Rust CUDA-руководство - это минималистичный, но мощный фреймворк для разработки ИИ с 35+ guardrails и поддержкой языков như TypeScript, Python, Go и Rust دليل CUDA هو إطار عمل تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي المحدود، ولكن القوي، مع 35+ حواجز أمان ودعم للغات مثل TypeScript، Python، Go وRust how to use cuda-guide cuda-guide setup guide cuda-guide vs CUDA Toolkit cuda-guide install for GPU computing what is cuda-guide cuda-guide alternative for deep learning cuda-guide tutorial for scientific computing cuda-guide documentation for TypeScript developers cuda-guide best practices for Python developers CUDA Guide AI 辅助开发 并行计算 内存优化 GPU 计算 深度学习 TypeScript Python Go Rust Applies Parallelism First principle for designing algorithms with thousands of concurrent threads Optimizes memory access with Memory Hierarchy Awareness and Coalesced Access Supports CUDA 11+ for GPU computing and deep learning applications Includes auto-loading language guides for TypeScript, Python, Go, and Rust Utilizes 4D methodology for efficient system design cuda-guide is a production-ready CLAUDE.md & AGENTS.md system with 35+ guardrails, 4D methodology, and auto-loading language guides for various programming languages.');
