e coordina la planificación y evaluación de código","fr":"Un agent d''architecture est un outil d''intelligence artificielle qui coordonne la planification et l''évaluation de code","de":"Ein Architekturagent ist ein künstliches Intelligenztool, das die Planung und Bewertung von Code koordiniert","pt":"O que é Architect-Agent? É um skill que facilita a coordenação entre arquitetos e agentes de código","ru":"Что такое Архитектор-агент? Это навык, который облегчает координацию между архитекторами и кодировочными агентами","ar":"ما هو وكيل المعماري؟ هو مهارة تسهل التنسيق بين المعماريين ووكلاء الكود"},"features":{"en":["Coordinates planning, delegation, and evaluation across architect and code agent workspaces","Supports quick start commands like ''write instructions for code agent'' and ''initialize workspace''","Utilizes intent classification for efficient workflow management","Employs decision trees for automated evaluation and grading","Allows for resource loading policy customization","Follows critical protocol for secure and reliable workflow setup"],"zh":["Intent Classification","Decision Tree","Resource Loading Policy","Critical Protocol: F","自动化代码协作","代码管理工作流"],"ja":["Intent Classification","Decision Tree","Resource Loading Policy","Critical Protocol: F","AIエージェントによるコード管理","コード管理ワークフロー"],"ko":["Intent Classification","Decision Tree","Resource Loading Policy","Critical Protocol: F","자동화된 코드 에이전트 워크플로","코드 관리 작업 흐름"],"es":["Coordina la planificación y evaluación de código","Utiliza un árbol de decisión para la evaluación","Carga de recursos según una política de carga","Soporte para la clasificación de intenciones","Inicialización de espacio de trabajo para código"],"fr":["Coordonne la planification et l''évaluation de code","Utilise un arbre de décision pour l''évaluation","Chargement de ressources selon une politique de chargement","Prise en charge de la classification d''intentions","Initialisation de l''espace de travail pour le code"],"de":["Koordiniert die Planung und Bewertung von Code","Verwendet einen Entscheidungsbaum für die Bewertung","Ressourcenladen nach einer Laderichtlinie","Unterstützung für die Klassifizierung von Absichten","Initialisierung des Arbeitsbereichs für Code"],"pt":["Coordenação de planejamento e delegação","Avaliação de trabalho","Inicialização de workspace","Envio de instruções para o agente de código","Classificação de intenções","Política de carregamento de recursos"],"ru":["Координация планирования и делегирования","Оценка работы","Инициализация рабочего пространства","Отправка инструкций кодировочному агенту","Классификация намерений","Политика загрузки ресурсов"],"ar":["تنسيق التخطيط والتفويض","تقييم العمل","تخصيص بيئة العمل","إرسال تعليمات إلى وكيل الكود","تصنيف النيات","سياسة تحميل الموارد"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use architect-agent","architect-agent setup guide","architect-agent alternative","architect-agent vs competitor","architect-agent install","what is architect-agent","architect-agent workflow management","intent classification in architect-agent","decision trees in architect-agent"],"zh":["Architect Agent","代码协作工具","AI代码管理","自动化代码管理","代码工作流","Intent Classification","Decision Tree","Resource Loading Policy"],"ja":["Architect Agent","AIエージェント","コード管理ツール","自動化コード管理","コードワークフロー","Intent Classification","Decision Tree","Resource Loading Policy"],"ko":["Architect Agent","코드 에이전트","자동화된 코드 관리","코드 협업 도구","코드 작업 흐름","Intent Classification","Decision Tree","Resource Loading Policy"],"es":["agente de arquitectura","herramientas de inteligencia artificial","desarrollo de código","planificación de código","evaluación de código","clasificación de intenciones","árbol de decisión","carga de recursos","initialización de espacio de trabajo"],"fr":["agent d''architecture","outils d''intelligence artificielle","développement de code","planification de code","évaluation de code","classification d''intentions","arbre de décision","chargement de ressources","initialisation de l''espace de travail"],"de":["Architekturagent","künstliche Intelligenztools","Code-Entwicklung","Code-Planung","Code-Bewertung","Klassifizierung von Absichten","Entscheidungsbaum","Ressourcenladen","Initialisierung des Arbeitsbereichs"],"pt":["Architect-Agent","coordenação de trabalho","planejamento e delegação","avaliação de trabalho","inicialização de workspace","envio de instruções","classificação de intenções","política de carregamento de recursos","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Архитектор-агент","координация работы","планирование и делегирование","оценка работы","инициализация рабочего пространства","отправка инструкций","классификация намерений","политика загрузки ресурсов","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["وكيل المعماري","تنسيق العمل","التخطيط والتفويض","تقييم العمل","تخصيص بيئة العمل","إرسال تعليمات","تصنيف النيات","سياسة تحميل الموارد","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"SpillwaveSolutions","repo":"agent_rulez","repoPath":"SpillwaveSolutions/agent_rulez","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.313Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"architect-agent","description":"Coordinates planning, delegation, and evaluation across architect and code agent workspaces. Use when asked to write instructions for code agent, initialize architect workspace, grade code agent work, send instructions, or verify code agent setup.","version":"3.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Architect Agent Workflow Skill\n\nCoordinate planning, delegation, and evaluation across architect and code agent workspaces.\n\n**Quick Start:** Say \"write instructions for code agent\", \"initialize workspace\", \"grade work\", or \"send instructions\". For automated setup, see [Quick Setup](#quick-setup-template-based).\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [Intent Classification](#intent-classification)\n- [Decision Tree](#decision-tree)\n- [Resource Loading Policy](#resource-loading-policy)\n- [Critical Protocol: F","body":"# Architect Agent Workflow Skill\n\nCoordinate planning, delegation, and evaluation across architect and code agent workspaces.\n\n**Quick Start:** Say \"write instructions for code agent\", \"initialize workspace\", \"grade work\", or \"send instructions\". For automated setup, see [Quick Setup](#quick-setup-template-based).\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [Intent Classification](#intent-classification)\n- [Decision Tree](#decision-tree)\n- [Resource Loading Policy](#resource-loading-policy)\n- [Critical Protocol: File Locations](#critical-protocol-file-locations)\n- [Quick Setup](#quick-setup-template-based)\n- [DO NOT Trigger For](#do-not-trigger-for)\n- [Reference Directory](#reference-directory)\n- [Guides Directory](#guides-directory)\n\n## Intent Classification\n\nRoute requests based on user intent:\n\n| Intent | Trigger Phrases | Action |\n|--------|-----------------|--------|\n| **Create Instructions** | \"write instructions\", \"create instructions\", \"delegate to code agent\" | → Load `guides/workflows/create-instructions.md` |\n| **Initialize Workspace** | \"set up architect agent\", \"initialize workspace\", \"new architect agent\" | → Load `guides/workflows/initialize-workspace.md` |\n| **Grade Work** | \"grade the work\", \"evaluate completed work\", \"review implementation\" | → Load `guides/workflows/grade-work.md` |\n| **Send Instructions** | \"send instructions\", \"send to code agent\" | → Load `guides/workflows/send-instructions.md` |\n| **Add OpenCode Support** | \"migrate to OpenCode\", \"add OpenCode support\" | → Load `references/opencode_integration_quickstart.md` |\n| **Verify Setup** | \"verify setup\", \"test hooks\", \"check logging\" | → Load `references/workspace_verification_protocol.md` |\n| **Setup Permissions** | \"set up permissions\", \"fix permission prompts\" | → Load `references/permissions_setup_protocol.md` |\n| **Upgrade Workspace** | \"upgrade workspace\", \"migrate to v3.0\" | → Load `references/upgrade.md` |\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n| User Intent | Pre-condition | Action |\n|-------------|---------------|--------|\n| \"write/create instructions\", \"delegate\" | `instructions/` exists | Load `guides/workflows/create-instructions.md` |\n| \"write/create instructions\", \"delegate\" | `instructions/` missing | Suggest workspace initialization first |\n| \"set up/initialize\" workspace | Directories don''t exist | Load `guides/workflows/initialize-workspace.md` |\n| \"set up/initialize\" workspace | Directories exist | Warn: already initialized |\n| \"grade\", \"evaluate\" work | `grades/` exists | Load `guides/workflows/grade-work.md` |\n| \"grade\", \"evaluate\" work | `grades/` missing | Suggest workspace initialization first |\n| \"send instructions\" | — | Load `guides/workflows/send-instructions.md` (bash copy, no agents) |\n| \"verify\", \"test hooks\" | — | Load `references/workspace_verification_protocol.md` |\n| \"OpenCode\", \"dual-mode\" | — | Load `references/opencode_integration_quickstart.md` |\n| \"permissions\" | — | Load `references/permissions_setup_protocol.md` |\n| \"upgrade\", \"migrate\" | — | Load `references/upgrade.md` |\n\n## Resource Loading Policy\n\n**Load ONLY when needed:**\n- Workflow guides: When intent is classified\n- Reference docs: When user needs detailed protocol\n- Templates: When creating workspace or files\n- Never load all references \"just in case\"\n\n**Core Resources by Intent:**\n\n| Intent | Primary Resource | Supporting Resources |\n|--------|-----------------|---------------------|\n| Create Instructions | `guides/workflows/create-instructions.md` | `references/instruction_structure.md`, `references/human_instruction_structure.md`, `references/file_naming.md` |\n| Initialize Workspace | `guides/workflows/initialize-workspace.md` | `references/workspace_setup_complete.md` |\n| Grade Work | `guides/workflows/grade-work.md` | `references/grading_rubrics.md`, `references/decision_types.md` |\n| Send Instructions | `guides/workflows/send-instructions.md` | (none - simple bash copy) |\n| Verify Setup | `references/workspace_verification_protocol.md` | `references/pre_work_checklist.md` |\n| Setup Permissions | `references/permissions_setup_protocol.md` | - |\n| OpenCode Support | `references/opencode_integration_quickstart.md` | `references/opencode_setup_guide.md` |\n\n## Critical Protocol: File Locations\n\n**The architect agent operates in its own workspace, NOT the code agent workspace.**\n\n| Artifact | Architect Writes To | Code Agent Location |\n|----------|--------------------|--------------------|\n| Instructions | `[ARCHITECT]/instructions/` | Reads from `debugging/instructions/` |\n| Human Instructions | `[ARCHITECT]/human/` | N/A (for manual execution) |\n| Grades | `[ARCHITECT]/grades/` | N/A |\n| Logs | N/A | Writes to `[CODE_AGENT]/debugging/logs/` |\n\n**Human Instructions = Executable Documentation** (not summaries!)\n\nHuman instructions must enable manual execution when code agents are unavailable. Include copy-pasteable commands, expected output, and troubleshooting. See `references/human_instruction_structure.md`.\n\n**Guard Rail:** If about to write to the code agent''s workspace, stop and verify the operation.\n\n## Quick Setup (Template-Based)\n\nFor fastest setup, use templates:\n\n```bash\ncd ~/.claude/skills/architect-agent/templates/\n\n# Create code agent workspace\n./setup-workspace.sh code-agent ~/projects/my-code-agent\n\n# Create architect workspace\n./setup-workspace.sh architect ~/projects/my-architect \\\n    --code-agent-path ~/projects/my-code-agent\n```\n\n**Time:** <5 minutes\n**See:** `templates/README.md`\n\n## DO NOT Trigger For\n\n- General architecture discussions\n- Brainstorming or exploration\n- Reading/analyzing existing code\n- Research tasks\n- Any work that isn''t explicit instruction creation, grading, or setup\n\n## Reference Directory\n\nAll detailed protocols are in `references/`. Load only what is needed for the current task.\n\n### Core References (Instruction & Grading)\n\n| Reference | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `instruction_structure.md` | Code agent instruction template |\n| `human_instruction_structure.md` | Human-executable instruction template |\n| `grading_rubrics.md` | 6-category grading criteria |\n| `instruction_grading_workflow.md` | Full grading workflow |\n| `decision_types.md` | decision, rationale, investigation, verification, deviation, milestone |\n| `file_naming.md` | Timestamp and naming conventions |\n\n### Setup & Configuration\n\n| Reference | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `installation.md` | Skill installation guide |\n| `quick_start.md` | Fast-track setup |\n| `workspace_setup_complete.md` | Full workspace initialization |\n| `workspace_verification_protocol.md` | Verify setup is correct |\n| `permissions_setup_protocol.md` | Cross-workspace permissions |\n| `upgrade.md` | Upgrade to latest version |\n\n### Logging & Debugging\n\n| Reference | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `logging_protocol.md` | Hybrid logging v2.0 |\n| `hybrid_logging_protocol.md` | Detailed hybrid logging spec |\n| `hook_configuration_critical.md` | Hook setup requirements |\n| `hook_logger_enhancements.md` | Hook logger improvements |\n| `pre_work_checklist.md` | Code agent pre-work verification |\n| `get_unstuck_protocol.md` | Recovery from blockers |\n| `resilience_protocol.md` | Error recovery patterns |\n| `testing_protocol.md` | Progressive testing requirements |\n\n### OpenCode Integration\n\n| Reference | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `opencode_integration_quickstart.md` | Dual-mode quick start |\n| `opencode_setup_guide.md` | Full OpenCode setup |\n| `opencode_migration_guide.md` | Migrate to OpenCode |\n| `opencode_logging_protocol.md` | OpenCode-specific logging |\n| `opencode_wrapper_setup.md` | Wrapper script setup |\n| `claude_vs_opencode_comparison.md` | Feature comparison |\n\n### Agent Configuration\n\n| Reference | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `agent_specialization.md` | Agent role configuration |\n| `code_agent_claude_template.md` | CLAUDE.md template for code agents |\n| `code_agent_agents_template.md` | AGENTS.md template for code agents |\n\n### Project Management\n\n| Reference | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `git_pr_management.md` | Git and PR workflow |\n| `ticket_tracking_pr_management.md` | Ticket and PR tracking |\n\n## Guides Directory\n\nStep-by-step workflows in `guides/workflows/`:\n\n| Guide | Trigger |\n|-------|---------|\n| `create-instructions.md` | \"write instructions for code agent\" |\n| `grade-work.md` | \"grade the code agent''s work\" |\n| `send-instructions.md` | \"send instructions to code agent\" |\n| `initialize-workspace.md` | \"set up architect agent workspace\" |\n\n### Templates\n\nReady-to-use workspace templates in `templates/`:\n\n| Template | Purpose |\n|----------|---------|\n| `setup-workspace.sh` | Automated workspace creation script |\n| `architect-workspace/` | Complete architect agent workspace template |\n| `code-agent-workspace/` | Complete code agent workspace template |\n\n**See:** `templates/README.md` for usage instructions.\n\n---"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:38.780Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing streamlined workflow coordination between architect and code agent workspaces.","zh":"适用于像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要在架构师和代码代理工作空间之间实现流畅的工作流协调。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeのようなAIエージェントに適しており、建築家とコードエージェントのワークスペース間でスムーズなワークフロー調整が必要です。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 아키텍트와 코드 에이전트 워크스페이스 간에 원활한 워크플로우 조정을 필요로 합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan una coordinación de flujo de trabajo optimizada entre los espacios de trabajo del arquitecto y del agente de código.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant une coordination de workflow optimisée entre les espaces de travail de l''architecte et de l''agent de code.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die eine optimierte Workflow-Koordination zwischen den Arbeitsbereichen des Architekten und des Code-Agents benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de coordenação de fluxo de trabalho otimizada entre os ambientes de trabalho do arquiteto e do agente de código.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым требуется упрощенная координация рабочего процесса между рабочими пространствами архитектора и агента кода.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى تنسيق سير عمل متدفق بين مساحات عمل المعماري وعميل الكود."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage intent classification and decision trees for efficient planning, delegation, and evaluation, enhancing developer and architect collaboration through automated workflows and resource loading policies.","zh":"赋予代理使用意图分类和决策树进行高效规划、委派和评估，通过自动化工作流和资源加载策略增强开发人员和架构师的协作。","ja":"代理がインテント分類と決定木を使用して効率的な計画、委任、評価を行うことを可能にし、自動化されたワークフローとリソースロードポリシーを通じて開発者とアーキテクトのコラボレーションを強化します。","ko":"에이전트가 의도 분류와 의사 결정 트리를 사용하여 효율적인 계획, 위임, 평가를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 자동화된 워크플로우와 리소스 로드 정책을 통해 개발자와 아키텍트의 협력을 강화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar la clasificación de intenciones y los árboles de decisión para una planificación, delegación y evaluación eficientes, mejorando la colaboración entre desarrolladores y arquitectos a través de flujos de trabajo automatizados y políticas de carga de recursos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter la classification d''intention et les arbres de décision pour une planification, une délégation et une évaluation efficaces, améliorant la collaboration entre les développeurs et les architectes via des flux de travail automatisés et des politiques de chargement de ressources.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Intent-Classification und Entscheidungsbäume für eine effiziente Planung, Delegation und Bewertung zu nutzen, wodurch die Zusammenarbeit zwischen Entwicklern und Architekten durch automatisierte Workflows und Ressourcenladepolitiken verbessert wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes utilizem a classificação de intenções e árvores de decisão para planejamento, delegação e avaliação eficientes, melhorando a colaboração entre desenvolvedores e arquitetos por meio de fluxos de trabalho automatizados e políticas de carregamento de recursos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать классификацию намерений и деревья решений для эффективного планирования, делегирования и оценки, повышая сотрудничество между разработчиками и архитекторами посредством автоматизированных рабочих процессов и политик загрузки ресурсов.","ar":"يمكن للعميل استخدام تصنيف النية وأشجار القرار للتنظيم والتفويض والتقييم الفعال، وتحسين التعاون بين المطوّرين والمصمّمين من خلال سير عمل آلي وصّيات تحميل الموارد."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating workspace initialization for code agents","Generating instructions for code agents using intent classification","Evaluating and grading work based on decision tree protocols"],"zh":["为代码代理自动化工作空间初始化","使用意图分类为代码代理生成指令","根据决策树协议评估和评分工作"],"ja":["コードエージェントのワークスペース初期化を自動化する","インテント分類を使用してコードエージェントの指示を生成する","決定木プロトコルに基づいて作業を評価して評価する"],"ko":["코드 에이전트의 워크스페이스 초기화를 자동화하는 것","의도 분류를 사용하여 코드 에이전트의 지시를 생성하는 것","의사 결정 트리 프로토콜을 기반으로 작업을 평가하고 평가하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la inicialización del espacio de trabajo para los agentes de código","Generación de instrucciones para los agentes de código mediante la clasificación de intenciones","Evaluación y calificación del trabajo según los protocolos del árbol de decisión"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''initialisation de l''espace de travail pour les agents de code","Génération d''instructions pour les agents de code à l''aide de la classification d''intention","Évaluation et notation du travail en fonction des protocoles de l''arbre de décision"],"de":["Automatisierung der Initialisierung des Arbeitsbereichs für Code-Agents","Erzeugung von Anweisungen für Code-Agents mithilfe der Intent-Classification","Bewertung und Benotung der Arbeit basierend auf den Protokollen des Entscheidungsbaums"],"pt":["Automatizar a inicialização do espaço de trabalho para agentes de código","Gerar instruções para agentes de código usando classificação de intenções","Avaliar e classificar o trabalho com base em protocolos de árvore de decisão"],"ru":["Автоматизировать инициализацию рабочего пространства для агентов кода","Генерировать инструкции для агентов кода с использованием классификации намерений","Оценивать и оценивать работу на основе протоколов дерева решений"],"ar":["توفير تشغيل آلي لبدء عمل مساحات عمل عميل الكود","إصدار تعليمات لعميل الكود باستخدام تصنيف النية","تقييم العمل وتحديد مستوياته بناءً على بروتوكولات شجرة القرار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires comprehensive understanding of architect and code agent workspaces","Dependent on specific resource loading policies","Critical protocol adherence necessary for optimal functionality"],"zh":["需要对架构师和代码代理工作空间有全面的理解","依赖于特定的资源加载策略","对于最佳功能需要严格遵守关键协议"],"ja":["アーキテクトとコードエージェントのワークスペースについて包括的な理解が必要","特定のリソースロードポリシーに依存している","最適な機能を実現するには重要なプロトコルの遵守が必要"],"ko":["아키텍트와 코드 에이전트의 워크스페이스에 대한 포괄적인 이해가 필요함","특정 리소스 로드 정책에 의존함","최적의 기능을 달성하기 위해서는 중요한 프로토콜을 준수해야 함"],"es":["Requiere una comprensión integral de los espacios de trabajo del arquitecto y del agente de código","Dependiente de políticas de carga de recursos específicas","Se requiere una adherencia crítica al protocolo para una funcionalidad óptima"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension complète des espaces de travail de l''architecte et de l''agent de code","Dépendant de politiques de chargement de ressources spécifiques","Une adhésion critique au protocole est nécessaire pour une fonctionnalité optimale"],"de":["Erfordert ein umfassendes Verständnis der Arbeitsbereiche des Architekten und des Code-Agents","Abhängig von spezifischen Ressourcenladepolitiken","Eine kritische Protokolladierung ist für eine optimale Funktionalität erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige uma compreensão abrangente dos ambientes de trabalho do arquiteto e do agente de código","Depende de políticas específicas de carregamento de recursos","Adesão crítica ao protocolo necessária para funcionalidade ótima"],"ru":["Требует всестороннего понимания рабочих пространств архитектора и агента кода","Зависит от конкретных политик загрузки ресурсов","Критическая приверженность протоколу необходима для оптимальной функциональности"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا شاملاً لمساحات عمل المعماري وعميل الكود","يعتمد على صّيات تحميل الموارد المحددة","الالتزام الحاسم بالبروتوكول ضروري لتحقيق الوظائف المثلى"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"3cb2e039d77927a4d2b0d7b8ea4d6ada58f099db0139ba368748909d0dae7e1f","qualityScore":50}');
