INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('gursheyss/styx/turborepo', 'turborepo', 'gursheyss', 'styx', 'community', 'turborepo gursheyss styx community Turborepo is a build system for JavaScript and TypeScript monorepos, caching task outputs and running tasks in parallel based on dependency graphs. It benefits developers working on large-scale projects. Turborepo 是一个用于 JavaScript/TypeScript monorepo 的构建系统，通过缓存任务输出和并行运行任务来提高性能 Turborepo は JavaScript/TypeScript モノレポ用のビルドシステムで、タスクの出力をキャッシュし、依存関係に基づいてタスクを並列実行することでパフォーマンスを向上させる Turborepo는 JavaScript/TypeScript 모노레포를 위한 빌드 시스템으로, 태스크 출력을 캐싱하고 의존성 그래프를 기반으로 태스크를 병렬적으로 실행하여 성능을 향상시킵니다 Turborepo es un sistema de compilación para monorepos JavaScript/TypeScript que almacena en caché las salidas de las tareas y ejecuta tareas en paralelo según el grafo de dependencias. Turborepo est un système de construction pour les monorepos JavaScript/TypeScript qui met en cache les sorties des tâches et exécute les tâches en parallèle en fonction du graphe de dépendances. Turborepo ist ein Build-System für JavaScript/TypeScript-Monorepos, das Task-Ausgaben zwischenspeichert und Tasks parallel basierend auf der Abhängigkeitsgrafik ausführt. Turborepo é um sistema de compilação para monorepos JavaScript e TypeScript que melhora a eficiência do desenvolvimento Turborepo — это система сборки для монорепозиториев JavaScript и TypeScript, повышающая эффективность разработки Turborepo هو نظام بناء لمونوريبو جافاسكريبت و타입스크립트 الذي يحسن كفاءة التطوير how to use turborepo turborepo vs lerna turborepo install turborepo setup guide what is turborepo turborepo alternative turborepo tutorial turborepo monorepo management turborepo dependency graph Turborepo JavaScript monorepo TypeScript monorepo 构建系统 性能优化 缓存任务输出 并行运行任务 Caches task outputs to improve build performance Runs tasks in parallel based on dependency graphs Requires package tasks to be registered in root turbo.json Supports task delegation via ''turbo run <task>'' in root package.json Enforces package tasks over root tasks for efficient builds Turborepo is a build system for JavaScript and TypeScript monorepos that caches task outputs and runs tasks in parallel based on dependency graphs.');
