e nativas (iOS/Android)","Otimização de bundling","Padrões de código para melhoria de desempenho","Comandos de shell para medição e processo"],"ru":["Оптимизация JavaScript/React","Оптимизация нативных (iOS/Android)","Оптимизация пакетов","Шаблоны кода для улучшения производительности","Команды shell для измерения и процесса"],"ar":["تحسين جافا سكريبت/رياكت","تحسين الأصلية (iOS/Android)","تحسين التجميع","نماذج код لتحسين الأداء","أوامر شل لقياس والعملية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use react-native-best-practices","react-native-best-practices setup guide","react-native performance optimization","react-native-best-practices alternative","react-native-best-practices vs native code","install react-native-best-practices","react-native-best-practices tutorial","react-native optimization techniques","react-native-best-practices benefits","react-native performance improvement"],"zh":["React Native 优化","JavaScript 优化","React 最佳实践","本地代码优化","打包优化","React Native 性能"],"ja":["React Native 最適化","JavaScript 最適化","React ベストプラクティス","ネイティブコード最適化","バンドル最適化","React Native パフォーマンス"],"ko":["React Native 최적화","JavaScript 최적화","React 베스트 프랙티스","네이티브 코드 최적화","번들 최적화","React Native 성능"],"es":["react native optimización","mejores prácticas react native","optimización de rendimiento react native","guias de react native","herramientas de react native","react native ai agent"],"fr":["optimisation react native","meilleures pratiques react native","optimisation des performances react native","guides react native","outils react native","react native outil ia"],"de":["react native optimierung","best practices react native","leistungsoptimierung react native","leitfäden react native","tools react native","react native kii agent"],"pt":["react native otimização","melhores práticas react native","otimização de desempenho react native","javascript react native","nativas react native","bundling react native"],"ru":["react native оптимизация","лучшие практики react native","оптимизация производительности react native","javascript react native","нативные react native","пакеты react native"],"ar":["رياكت نيتيف تحسين","أفضل الممارسات رياكت نيتيف","تحسين الأداء رياكت نيتيف","جافا سكريبت رياكت نيتيف","الأصلية رياكت نيتيف","التجميع رياكت نيتيف"]}},"owner":"NextLogic2025","repo":"frontendCafrisales","repoPath":"NextLogic2025/frontendCafrisales","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.337Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-native-best-practices","description":"Provides React Native performance optimization guidelines for FPS, TTI, bundle size, memory leaks, re-renders, and animations. Applies to tasks involving Hermes optimization, JS thread blocking, bridge overhead, FlashList, native modules, or debugging jank and frame drops.","tags":"react-native, expo, performance, optimization, profiling","bodyPreview":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement sk","body":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement skills\n- **Quick Config**: Configuration snippets for setup-focused skills\n- **Quick Reference**: Summary tables for conceptual skills\n- **Deep Dive**: Full context with When to Use, Prerequisites, Step-by-Step, Common Pitfalls\n\n**Impact ratings**: CRITICAL (fix immediately), HIGH (significant improvement), MEDIUM (worthwhile optimization)\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Debugging slow/janky UI or animations\n- Investigating memory leaks (JS or native)\n- Optimizing app startup time (TTI)\n- Reducing bundle or app size\n- Writing native modules (Turbo Modules)\n- Profiling React Native performance\n- Reviewing React Native code for performance\n\n## Priority-Ordered Guidelines\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | FPS & Re-renders | CRITICAL | `js-*` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size | CRITICAL | `bundle-*` |\n| 3 | TTI Optimization | HIGH | `native-*`, `bundle-*` |\n| 4 | Native Performance | HIGH | `native-*` |\n| 5 | Memory Management | MEDIUM-HIGH | `js-*`, `native-*` |\n| 6 | Animations | MEDIUM | `js-*` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Critical: FPS & Re-renders\n\n**Profile first:**\n```bash\n# Open React Native DevTools\n# Press ''j'' in Metro, or shake device → \"Open DevTools\"\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Replace ScrollView with FlatList/FlashList for lists\n- Use React Compiler for automatic memoization\n- Use atomic state (Jotai/Zustand) to reduce re-renders\n- Use `useDeferredValue` for expensive computations\n\n### Critical: Bundle Size\n\n**Analyze bundle:**\n```bash\nnpx react-native bundle \\\n  --entry-file index.js \\\n  --bundle-output output.js \\\n  --platform ios \\\n  --sourcemap-output output.js.map \\\n  --dev false --minify true\n\nnpx source-map-explorer output.js --no-border-checks\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Avoid barrel imports (import directly from source)\n- Remove unnecessary Intl polyfills (Hermes has native support)\n- Enable tree shaking (Expo SDK 52+ or Re.Pack)\n- Enable R8 for Android native code shrinking\n\n### High: TTI Optimization\n\n**Measure TTI:**\n- Use `react-native-performance` for markers\n- Only measure cold starts (exclude warm/hot/prewarm)\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Disable JS bundle compression on Android (enables Hermes mmap)\n- Use native navigation (react-native-screens)\n- Defer non-critical work with `InteractionManager`\n\n### High: Native Performance\n\n**Profile native:**\n- iOS: Xcode Instruments → Time Profiler\n- Android: Android Studio → CPU Profiler\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Use background threads for heavy native work\n- Prefer async over sync Turbo Module methods\n- Use C++ for cross-platform performance-critical code\n\n## References\n\nFull documentation with code examples in `references/`:\n\n### JavaScript/React (`js-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md` | CRITICAL | Replace ScrollView with virtualized lists |\n| `js-profile-react.md` | MEDIUM | React DevTools profiling |\n| `js-measure-fps.md` | HIGH | FPS monitoring and measurement |\n| `js-memory-leaks.md` | MEDIUM | JS memory leak hunting |\n| `js-atomic-state.md` | HIGH | Jotai/Zustand patterns |\n| `js-concurrent-react.md` | HIGH | useDeferredValue, useTransition |\n| `js-react-compiler.md` | HIGH | Automatic memoization |\n| `js-animations-reanimated.md` | MEDIUM | Reanimated worklets |\n| `js-uncontrolled-components.md` | HIGH | TextInput optimization |\n\n### Native (`native-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `native-turbo-modules.md` | HIGH | Building fast native modules |\n| `native-sdks-over-polyfills.md` | HIGH | Native vs JS libraries |\n| `native-measure-tti.md` | HIGH | TTI measurement setup |\n| `native-threading-model.md` | HIGH | Turbo Module threads |\n| `native-profiling.md` | MEDIUM | Xcode/Android Studio profiling |\n| `native-platform-setup.md` | MEDIUM | iOS/Android tooling guide |\n| `native-view-flattening.md` | MEDIUM | View hierarchy debugging |\n| `native-memory-patterns.md` | MEDIUM | C++/Swift/Kotlin memory |\n| `native-memory-leaks.md` | MEDIUM | Native memory leak hunting |\n| `native-android-16kb-alignment.md` | CRITICAL | Third-party library alignment for Google Play |\n\n### Bundling (`bundle-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `bundle-barrel-exports.md` | CRITICAL | Avoid barrel imports |\n| `bundle-analyze-js.md` | CRITICAL | JS bundle visualization |\n| `bundle-tree-shaking.md` | HIGH | Dead code elimination |\n| `bundle-analyze-app.md` | HIGH | App size analysis |\n| `bundle-r8-android.md` | HIGH | Android code shrinking |\n| `bundle-hermes-mmap.md` | HIGH | Disable bundle compression |\n| `bundle-native-assets.md` | HIGH | Asset catalog setup |\n| `bundle-library-size.md` | MEDIUM | Evaluate dependencies |\n| `bundle-code-splitting.md` | MEDIUM | Re.Pack code splitting |\n\n## Searching References\n\n```bash\n# Find patterns by keyword\ngrep -l \"reanimated\" references/\ngrep -l \"flatlist\" references/\ngrep -l \"memory\" references/\ngrep -l \"profil\" references/\ngrep -l \"tti\" references/\ngrep -l \"bundle\" references/\n```\n\n## Problem → Skill Mapping\n\n| Problem | Start With |\n|---------|------------|\n| App feels slow/janky | `js-measure-fps.md` → `js-profile-react.md` |\n| Too many re-renders | `js-profile-react.md` → `js-react-compiler.md` |\n| Slow startup (TTI) | `native-measure-tti.md` → `bundle-analyze-js.md` |\n| Large app size | `bundle-analyze-app.md` → `bundle-r8-android.md` |\n| Memory growing | `js-memory-leaks.md` or `native-memory-leaks.md` |\n| Animation drops frames | `js-animations-reanimated.md` |\n| List scroll jank | `js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md` |\n| TextInput lag | `js-uncontrolled-components.md` |\n| Native module slow | `native-turbo-modules.md` → `native-threading-model.md` |\n| Native library alignment issue | `native-android-16kb-alignment.md` |\n\n## Attribution\n\nBased on \"The Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\" by Callstack.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:19.578Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile Development Agents seeking to optimize React Native application performance","zh":"适合寻求优化React Native应用程序性能的移动开发代理","ja":"React Nativeアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化しようとするモバイル開発エージェントに適しています","ko":"React Native 애플리케이션 성능을 최적화하려는 모바일 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo Móvil que buscan optimizar el rendimiento de aplicaciones React Native","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement mobile cherchant à optimiser les performances des applications React Native","de":"Perfekt für Mobile Development Agents, die die Leistung von React Native-Anwendungen optimieren möchten","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Móvel que buscam otimizar o desempenho de aplicativos React Native","ru":"Идеально подходит для Мобильных Разработчиков-Agentов, стремящихся оптимизировать производительность приложений React Native","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير الهاتف المحمول الذين يسعون لتحسين أداء تطبيقات React Native"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply JavaScript, Native, and bundling optimizations, leveraging Callstack''s Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization for improved app performance, utilizing Quick Pattern and Quick Command features for efficient code review and process measurement","zh":"赋予代理应用JavaScript、Native和捆绑优化的能力，利用Callstack的React Native优化终极指南来改善应用程序性能，使用快速模式和快速命令功能进行高效的代码审查和过程测量","ja":"エージェントにJavaScript、ネイティブ、バンドル最適化を適用する能力を与え、CallstackのReact Native最適化の究極のガイドを使用してアプリのパフォーマンスを改善し、効率的なコードレビューとプロセス測定のためにQuick PatternとQuick Command機能を使用する","ko":"에이전트에게 JavaScript, 네이티브, 번들 최적화를 적용할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 Callstack의 React Native 최적화 종합 가이드를 사용하여 애플리케이션 성능을 개선하고 효율적인 코드 검토 및 프로세스 측정을 위해 Quick Pattern 및 Quick Command 기능을 사용한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar optimizaciones de JavaScript, Nativo y empaquetado, aprovechando la Guía definitiva de Callstack para la optimización de React Native para mejorar el rendimiento de la aplicación, utilizando las funciones Quick Pattern y Quick Command para una revisión de código eficiente y medición de procesos","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des optimisations JavaScript, Native et de regroupement, en exploitant le Guide ultime de Callstack pour l''optimisation de React Native pour améliorer les performances de l''application, en utilisant les fonctionnalités Quick Pattern et Quick Command pour une revue de code efficace et une mesure de processus","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Optimierungen von JavaScript, Native und Bundling anzuwenden, indem sie Callstacks ultimative Anleitung zur Optimierung von React Native für eine verbesserte App-Leistung nutzen, unter Einsatz von Quick Pattern- und Quick Command-Features für eine effiziente Code-Überprüfung und Prozessmessung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar otimizações JavaScript, Nativa e de empacotamento, aproveitando o Guia Definitivo para Otimização do React Native da Callstack para melhorar o desempenho do aplicativo, utilizando recursos de Quick Pattern e Quick Command para revisão de código eficiente e medição de processos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применения оптимизаций JavaScript, Native и пакетирования, используя Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization от Callstack для улучшения производительности приложения, используя функции Quick Pattern и Quick Command для эффективного обзора кода и измерения процессов","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تطبيق تحسينات JavaScript و Native و التجميع ، مستفيدا من دليل Callstack الشامل لتحسين React Native لتحسين أداء التطبيق ، باستخدام ميزات Quick Pattern و Quick Command لمراجعة الكود والقياس الفعال للعملية"},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing React Native app performance through JavaScript and Native code improvements","Applying bundling optimizations for reduced app size and faster load times","Debugging performance issues using Quick Pattern and Quick Command references"],"zh":["通过JavaScript和Native代码改进来优化React Native应用程序性能","应用捆绑优化以减少应用程序大小和加快加载时间","使用快速模式和快速命令引用来调试性能问题"],"ja":["JavaScriptとネイティブコードの改善を通じてReact Nativeアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する","バンドル最適化を適用してアプリサイズを削減し、読み込み時間を短縮する","Quick PatternとQuick Commandリファレンスを使用してパフォーマンスの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["JavaScript 및 네이티브 코드 개선을 통해 React Native 애플리케이션 성능을 최적화한다","번들 최적화를 적용하여 애플리케이션 크기를 줄이고 로드 시간을 단축한다","Quick Pattern 및 Quick Command 참조를 사용하여 성능 문제를 디버깅한다"],"es":["Optimizar el rendimiento de la aplicación React Native a través de mejoras en el código JavaScript y Nativo","Aplicar optimizaciones de empaquetado para reducir el tamaño de la aplicación y tiempos de carga más rápidos","Depurar problemas de rendimiento utilizando referencias de Quick Pattern y Quick Command"],"fr":["Optimiser les performances de l''application React Native grâce à des améliorations du code JavaScript et Natif","Appliquer des optimisations de regroupement pour réduire la taille de l''application et des temps de chargement plus rapides","Déboguer les problèmes de performances en utilisant des références Quick Pattern et Quick Command"],"de":["Optimieren des React Native-App-Leistungsverhaltens durch Verbesserungen im JavaScript- und Native-Code","Anwenden von Bundling-Optimierungen zur Reduzierung der App-Größe und schnelleren Ladezeiten","Fehlerbehebung von Leistungsproblemen unter Verwendung von Quick Pattern- und Quick Command-Referenzen"],"pt":["Otimizando o desempenho do aplicativo React Native por meio de melhorias no código JavaScript e Nativo","Aplicando otimizações de empacotamento para reduzir o tamanho do aplicativo e melhorar os tempos de carregamento","Depurando problemas de desempenho usando referências de Quick Pattern e Quick Command"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности приложения React Native за счет улучшения кода JavaScript и Native","Применение оптимизаций пакетирования для уменьшения размера приложения и увеличения скорости загрузки","Отладка проблем производительности с помощью ссылок на Quick Pattern и Quick Command"],"ar":["تحسين أداء تطبيق React Native من خلال تحسينات في الكود JavaScript و Native","تطبيق تحسينات التجميع لتقليل حجم التط