ومبادئ الخصوصية"},"definition":{"en":"skale-dev is a comprehensive development guide for SKALE Network, covering technical aspects such as smart contracts, web/mobile integration, and privacy primitives using BITE Protocol.","zh":"SKALE 网络开发是指在 SKALE 网络上构建和部署智能合约、Web/Mobile 应用和跨链桥接的过程","ja":"SKALE ネットワーク開発とは、SKALE ネットワーク上でスマートコントラクト、Web/Mobile アプリ、クロスチェーンブリッジを構築してデプロイするプロセス","ko":"SKALE 네트워크 개발은 SKALE 네트워크에서 스마트 계약, 웹/모바일 애플리케이션 및 크로스체인 브릿지를 구축하고 배포하는 과정","es":"skale-dev es un conjunto de herramientas para desarrollar en SKALE Network, incluyendo contratos inteligentes y privacidad avanzada","fr":"skale-dev est un ensemble d''outils pour développer sur SKALE Network, incluant les contrats intelligents et la confidentialité avancée","de":"skale-dev ist ein Satz von Tools für die Entwicklung auf SKALE Network, einschließlich Smart Contracts und erweiterter Privatsphäre","pt":"O skale-dev é um conjunto de ferramentas para desenvolvedores que desejam criar aplicativos descentralizados na rede SKALE","ru":"Skale-dev - это набор инструментов для разработчиков, желающих создавать децентрализованные приложения в сети SKALE","ar":"skale-dev هو مجموعة من الأدوات لمطوري التطبيقات اللامركزية على شبكة SKALE"},"features":{"en":["Builds Solidity or EVM smart contracts for SKALE","Integrates SKALE into web applications or dApps","Deploys contracts to SKALE chains (Mainnet/Testnet/Sandbox)","Builds private EVM applications with encrypted transactions using BITE Protocol","Implements automated workflows for SKALE Network development"],"zh":["支持 Solidity 和 EVM 智能合约","提供 Web/Mobile 集成解决方案","实现跨链桥接和隐私原语","支持 BITE Protocol","提供 Mainnet/Testnet/Sandbox 部署选项"],"ja":["Solidity と EVM スマートコントラクトをサポート","Web/Mobile 統合ソリューションを提供","クロスチェーンブリッジとプライバシープリミティブを実現","BITE Protocol をサポート","Mainnet/Testnet/Sandbox デプロイオプションを提供"],"ko":["솔리디티 및 EVM 스마트 계약 지원","웹/모바일 통합 솔루션 제공","크로스체인 브릿지 및 프라이버시 원시 구현","BITE Protocol 지원","Mainnet/Testnet/Sandbox 배포 옵션 제공"],"es":["Desarrollo de contratos inteligentes en Solidity o EVM","Integración con aplicaciones web y móviles","Implementación de puentes de cadena cruzada","Privacidad avanzada con protocolo BITE","Despliegue de contratos en SKALE chains (Mainnet/Testnet/Sandbox)"],"fr":["Développement de contrats intelligents en Solidity ou EVM","Intégration avec des applications web et mobiles","Mise en œuvre de ponts de chaîne croisée","Confidentialité avancée avec le protocole BITE","Déploiement de contrats sur les chaînes SKALE (Mainnet/Testnet/Sandbox)"],"de":["Entwicklung von Smart Contracts in Solidity oder EVM","Integration mit Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen","Implementierung von Cross-Chain-Brücken","Erweiterte Privatsphäre mit BITE-Protokoll","Bereitstellung von Verträgen auf SKALE-Chain (Mainnet/Testnet/Sandbox)"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de smart contracts com Solidity","Integração web e mobile com a rede SKALE","Implementação de pontes de cadeias cruzadas","Uso de primitivos de privacidade com o protocolo BITE","Implantação de contratos em chains SKALE (Mainnet, Testnet, Sandbox)"],"ru":["Разработка умных контрактов с помощью Solidity","Веб- и мобильная интеграция с сетью SKALE","Реализация мостов между цепочками","Использование примитивов конфиденциальности с протоколом BITE","Развертывание контрактов в цепочках SKALE (Mainnet, Testnet, Sandbox)"],"ar":["تطوير العقود الذكية باستخدام Solidity","التكامل مع الويب والجوال لشبكة SKALE","تنفيذ جسور السلاسل المتقاطعة","استخدام مبادئ الخصوصية ببروتوكول BITE","نشر العقود على سلاسل SKALE (Mainnet، Testnet، Sandbox)"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use skale-dev","skale-dev setup guide","SKALE Network development","skale-dev vs Ethereum","skale-dev alternative","skale-dev install","what is skale-dev","SKALE Network smart contracts","BITE Protocol integration"],"zh":["SKALE 网络开发","智能合约","Web/Mobile 集成","跨链桥接","隐私原语","BITE Protocol","SKALE 网络设置","SKALE 网络开发指南"],"ja":["SKALE ネットワーク開発","スマートコントラクト","Web/Mobile 統合","クロスチェーンブリッジ","プライバシープリミティブ","BITE Protocol","SKALE ネットワーク設定","SKALE ネットワーク開発ガイド"],"ko":["SKALE 네트워크 개발","스마트 계약","웹/모바일 통합","크로스체인 브릿지","프라이버시 원시","BITE Protocol","SKALE 네트워크 설정","SKALE 네트워크 개발 가이드"],"es":["skale-dev","desarrollo de contratos inteligentes","integración web móvil","puentes de cadena cruzada","privacidad avanzada","SKALE Network","Solidity","EVM","BITE protocolo"],"fr":["skale-dev","développement de contrats intelligents","intégration web mobilité","ponts de chaîne croisée","confidentialité avancée","SKALE Network","Solidity","EVM","protocole BITE"],"de":["skale-dev","Entwicklung von Smart Contracts","Integration von Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen","Cross-Chain-Brücken","erweiterte Privatsphäre","SKALE Network","Solidity","EVM","BITE-Protokoll"],"pt":["skale-dev","desenvolvimento de smart contracts","integração web e mobile","pontes de cadeias cruzadas","primitivos de privacidade","protocolo BITE","rede SKALE"," Solidity"],"ru":["skale-dev","разработка умных контрактов","веб- и мобильная интеграция","мосты между цепочками","примитивы конфиденциальности","протокол BITE","сеть SKALE","Solidity"],"ar":["skale-dev","تطوير العقود الذكية","التكامل مع الويب والجوال","جسور السلاسل المتقاطعة","مبادئ الخصوصية","بروتوكول BITE","شبكة SKALE","Solidity"]}},"owner":"TheGreatAxios","repo":"nft-marketplace-skale-agent-skill-build-claude-code","repoPath":"TheGreatAxios/nft-marketplace-skale-agent-skill-build-claude-code","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.339Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skale-dev","description":"SKALE Network development guidelines for building scalable dApps, smart contracts, and cross-chain solutions (February 2026). Use when building Solidity contracts, integrating SKALE into web/mobile apps, deploying to SKALE chains, or implementing privacy with BITE Protocol.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# SKALE Network Development\n\nComprehensive development guide for SKALE Network, covering smart contracts, web/mobile integration, cross-chain bridges, and privacy primitives using BITE Protocol.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Building Solidity or EVM smart contracts for SKALE\n- Integrating SKALE into web applications or dApps\n- Deploying contracts to SKALE chains (Mainnet/Testnet/Sandbox)\n- Building private EVM applications with encrypted transactions\n- Implementing automa","body":"# SKALE Network Development\n\nComprehensive development guide for SKALE Network, covering smart contracts, web/mobile integration, cross-chain bridges, and privacy primitives using BITE Protocol.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Building Solidity or EVM smart contracts for SKALE\n- Integrating SKALE into web applications or dApps\n- Deploying contracts to SKALE chains (Mainnet/Testnet/Sandbox)\n- Building private EVM applications with encrypted transactions\n- Implementing automated on-chain transactions\n- Building cross-chain applications (SKALE↔Ethereum, SKALE↔Base, inter-SKALE)\n- Working with x402 and on-chain agents\n- Implementing privacy features with BITE Protocol threshold encryption\n- Bridging assets via skale-bridge\n\n## Development Areas\n\n| Area | Focus | Key Tools |\n|------|-------|-----------|\n| Smart Contracts | Solidity/EVM contracts for SKALE | Foundry, Hardhat, solidity-dev-tips |\n| Web Apps | Frontend integration with SKALE | Web3 SDKs, RPC endpoints |\n| Mobile Apps | Native SKALE mobile integration | Mobile SDKs |\n| Infrastructure | RPC, indexing, storage | SKALE Network endpoints |\n| Cross-Chain | Bridge integration | skale-bridge |\n| Privacy | Threshold encryption | BITE Protocol |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Chain Selection (CRITICAL)\n\n- `chain-target-correct` - Use correct chain: Mainnet/Testnet/Sandbox, Europa/Calypso\n- `chain-gas-terminology` - Use \"gas\" terminology correctly for SKALE (zero gas fee context)\n- `chain-naming` - Use \"SKALE\" not \"skale\" in all references\n\n### 2. Smart Contract Development (HIGH)\n\n- `contracts-compiler-settings` - Use correct Solidity compiler: Shanghai (≤0.8.24) for standard, Istanbul (≤0.8.20) for CTX\n- `contracts-solidity-patterns` - Apply solidity-dev-tips when using Foundry/Hardhat\n- `contracts-deployment` - Follow proper deployment sequences for SKALE chains (use `--legacy --slow` for Foundry)\n- `contracts-cross-chain` - Handle cross-chain message passing patterns\n\n### 3. Privacy (HIGH)\n\n- `privacy-bite-protocol` - Use BITE Protocol for threshold encryption of transaction data\n\n### 4. Bridge Integration (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `bridge-skale-bridge` - Use skale-bridge for asset movement to/from SKALE\n- `bridge-cross-chain-validation` - Validate cross-chain transactions properly\n- `bridge-error-handling` - Handle bridge failures and retries\n\n### 5. Web Application Integration (MEDIUM)\n\n- `web-rpc-endpoints` - Use correct SKALE RPC endpoints\n- `web-wallet-connection` - Implement wallet connection for SKALE chains\n- `web-transaction-handling` - Handle zero-gas transaction patterns\n\n### 6. Native Features (MEDIUM)\n\n- `random-number-generation` - Use SKALE native RNG at precompile 0x18\n\n### 7. x402 & Agents (MEDIUM)\n\n- `x402-onchain-agents` - Build with x402 on-chain agent standards\n- `x402-automation` - Implement automated transaction patterns\n\n### 8. Infrastructure (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `infra-indexing` - Set up indexing for SKALE chains\n- `infra-storage` - Configure storage solutions for SKALE\n- `infra-rpc-fallback` - Implement RPC endpoint fallback\n\n### 9. Chain-Specific Guides (MEDIUM)\n\n- `skale-on-base` - SKALE Base chain configuration and usage\n- `skale-on-ethereum` - Ethereum↔SKALE bridge integration\n\n## How to Work\n\n### Problem-Solving Workflow\n\n1. **Identify Development Area**\n   - Web Application, Mobile, Smart Contracts, Infrastructure, or External SDK\n\n2. **Clarify and Plan**\n   - Ask necessary questions for full clarity\n   - Create task list (verbose PRDs for new features)\n\n3. **Select Resources**\n   - Pull in context for tools/libraries/frameworks\n   - Access knowledge for your specific Area\n   - Identify correct blockchain target\n\n4. **Implement**\n   - Stay focused, avoid unapproved changes\n   - Use SKALE specifics: RPC endpoints, \"SKALE\" naming, \"gas\" terminology\n   - Use Foundry with `--legacy --slow` for SKALE deployments\n   - Use Shanghai compiler (≤0.8.24) for standard contracts, Istanbul (≤0.8.20) for CTX\n   - Build clean, simple, self-documenting code\n   - Provide exact file changes and commands\n\n5. **Deliverables**\n   - **Code changes**: Exact file changes, no rambling\n   - **Research**: Short, concise output with clear actions\n   - **Answers**: Brief, clear responses\n\n## Compiler Settings Summary\n\n| Feature | Compiler Version | Notes |\n|---------|-----------------|-------|\n| Standard contracts | Shanghai or lower (≤ 0.8.24) | Recommended: 0.8.24 |\n| Conditional TX (CTX) | Istanbul (≤ 0.8.20) | CTX requires Istanbul compiler |\n| BITE Phase I | Any supported version | No special requirements |\n\n## Foundry Deployment\n\nAlways use SKALE-specific flags:\n```bash\nforge script script/Deploy.s.s \\\n  --rpc-url $SKALE_RPC_URL \\\n  --private-key $PRIVATE_KEY \\\n  --legacy \\\n  --slow \\\n  --broadcast\n```\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `solidity-dev-tips` - Solidity best practices for Foundry/Hardhat\n- `BITE Protocol` - Threshold encryption for transaction privacy\n- `skale-bridge` - Asset bridging to/from SKALE\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:25.730Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Blockchain Agents needing comprehensive SKALE Network development capabilities, including smart contract and cross-chain bridge integration.","zh":"非常适合需要全面SKALE Network开发能力的区块链Agent，包括智能合约和跨链桥集成。","ja":"スマートコントラクトやクロスチェーンブリッジ統合を含む、包括的なSKALE Network開発機能を必要とするブロックチェーンAgentに最適です。","ko":"스마트 계약 및 크로스체인 브리지 통합을 포함한 포괄적인 SKALE Network 개발 기능이 필요한 블록체인 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Blockchain que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo de SKALE Network integrales, incluyendo integración de contratos inteligentes y puentes entre cadenas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de Blockchain qui ont besoin de capacités de développement de SKALE Network complètes, y compris l''intégration de contrats intelligents et de ponts entre chaînes.","de":"Perfekt für Blockchain-Agents, die umfassende SKALE Network-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten benötigen, einschließlich Smart-Contract- und Cross-Chain-Brückentintegration.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Blockchain que necessitam de capacidades abrangentes de desenvolvimento da SKALE Network, incluindo a integração de contratos inteligentes e pontes cross-chain.","ru":"Идеально подходит для блокчейн-агентов, которым требуются комплексные возможности разработки для сети SKALE Network, включая интеграцию смарт-контрактов и кросс-чейн мостов.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء Blockchain الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تطوير شاملة لشبكة SKALE Network، بما في ذلك تكامل العقود الذكية والجسور عبر السلاسل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build, deploy, and manage Solidity and EVM smart contracts on SKALE chains, leveraging BITE Protocol for private transactions and integrating web and mobile applications with SKALE Network''s cross-chain bridges.","zh":"赋能Agent在SKALE链上构建、部署和管理Solidity及EVM智能合约，利用BITE Protocol实现私有交易，并通过SKALE Network的跨链桥集成Web和移动应用程序。","ja":"SKALEチェーン上でSolidityおよびEVMスマートコントラクトの構築、デプロイ、管理を可能にし、BITE Protocolを活用したプライベート取引を実現し、SKALE Networkのクロスチェーンブリッジを通じてWebおよびモバイルアプリケーションを統合します。","ko":"SKALE 체인에서 Solidity 및 EVM 스마트 계약을 구축, 배포 및 관리할 수 있도록 지원하며, BITE Protocol을 활용한 개인 거래를 활용하고 SKALE Network의 크로스체인 브리지를 통해 웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션을 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, implementar y gestionar contratos inteligentes de Solidity y EVM en cadenas de SKALE, aprovechando el protocolo BITE para transacciones privadas e integrando aplicaciones web y móviles con los puentes entre cadenas de SKALE Network.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, de déployer et de gérer des contrats intelligents Solidity et EVM sur les chaînes SKALE, en exploitant le protocole BITE pour les transactions privées et en intégrant les applications web et mobiles avec les ponts entre chaînes de SKALE Network.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Solidity- und EVM-Smart-Verträge auf SKALE-Chain zu erstellen, bereitzustellen und zu verwalten, indem sie das BITE-Protokoll für private Transaktionen nutzen und Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen mit den Cross-Chain-Brücken von SKALE Network integrieren.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a construir, implementar e gerir contratos inteligentes Solidity e EVM em cadeias SKALE, aproveitando o BITE Protocol para transações privadas e integrando aplicações web e móveis com as pontes cross-chain da SKALE Network.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать, развертывать и управлять смарт-контрактами Solidity и EVM в сетях SKALE, используя BITE Protocol для приватных транзакций и интегрируя веб- и мобильные приложения с кросс-чейн мостами сети SKALE Network.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من بناء ونشر وإدارة العقود الذكية Solidity و EVM على سلاسل SKALE، والاستفادة من بروتوكول BITE للمعاملات الخاصة ودمج تطبيقات الويب والجوال مع الجسور عبر السلاسل لشبكة SKALE Network."},"useCases":{"en":["Building and deploying Solidity smart contracts on SKALE Mainnet and Testnet","Integrating SKALE Network with web and mobile applications for seamless user experience","Implementing private EVM applications with encrypted transactions using BITE Protocol"],"zh":["在SKALE主网和测试网上构建和部署Solidity智能合约","将SKALE Network与Web和移动应用程序集成以实现无缝用户体验","使用BITE Protocol通过加密交易实现私有EVM应用程序"],"ja":["SKALEメインネットおよびテストネットでのSolidityスマートコントラクトの構築とデプロイ","シームレスなユーザー体験のためにWebおよびモバイルアプリケーションとSKALE Networkを統合","BITE Protocolを使用した暗号化取引によるプライベートEVMアプリケーションの実装"],"ko":["SKALE 메인넷 및 테스트넷에서 Solidity 스마트 계약 구축 및 배포","원활한 사용자 경험을 위해 웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션과 SKALE Network 통합","BITE Protocol을 사용한 암호화된 거래로 프라이빗 EVM 애플리케이션 구현"],"es":["Creación e implementación de contratos inteligentes de Solidity en SKALE Mainnet y Testnet","Integración de SKALE Network con aplicaciones web y móviles para una experiencia de usuario sin problemas","Implementación de aplicaciones EVM privadas con transacciones cifradas utilizando el protocolo BITE"],"fr":["Création et déploiement de contrats intelligents Solidity sur SKALE Mainnet et Testnet","Intégration de SKALE Network avec des applications web et mobiles pour une expérience utilisateur sans accroc","Mise en œuvre d''applications EVM privées avec des transactions chiffrées en utilisant le protocole BITE"],"de":["Erstellung und Bereitstellung von Solidity-Smart-Verträgen auf SKALE Mainnet und Testnet","Integration von SKALE Network mit Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen für eine nahtlose Benutzererfahrung","Implementierung von privaten EVM-Anwendungen mit verschlüsselten Transaktionen unter Verwendung des BITE-Protokolls"],"pt":["Construção e implementação de contratos inteligentes Solidity na SKALE Mainnet e Testnet","Integração da SKALE Network com aplicações web e móveis para uma experiência de utilizador perfeita","Implementação de aplicações EVM privadas com transações encriptadas usando o BITE Protocol"],"ru":["Создание и развертывание смарт-контрактов Solidity в SKALE Mainnet и Testnet","Интеграция сети SKALE Network с веб- и мобильными приложениями для беспрерывного взаимодействия с пользователем","Реализация приватных приложений EVM с зашифрованными транзакциями с использованием BITE Protocol"],"ar":["بناء ونشر العقود الذكية Solidity على شبكتي SKALE الرئيسية واختبارية","دمج شبكة SKALE Network مع تطبيقات الويب والجوال لتجربة مستخدم سلسة","تنفيذ تطبيقات EVM خاصة مع معاملات مشفرة باستخدام بروتوكول BITE"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Solidity and EVM smart contract development","SKALE Network ecosystem specific, may not be compatible with other blockchain platforms"],"zh":["需要具备Solidity和EVM智能合约开发知识","特定于SKALE Network生态系统，可能与其他区块链平台不兼容"],"ja":["SolidityおよびEVMスマートコントラクト開発の知識が必要","SKALE Networkエコシステム固有であり、他のブロックチェーンプラットフォームと互換性がない可能性がある"],"ko":["Solidity 및 EVM 스마트 계약 개발 지식 필요","SKALE Network 생태계에 특화되어 있으며 다른 블록체인 플랫폼과 호환되지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de desarrollo de contratos inteligentes de Solidity y EVM","Específico del ecosistema de SKALE Network, puede que no sea compatible con otras plataformas de blockchain"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en développement de contrats intelligents Solidity et EVM","Spécifique à l''écosystème de SKALE Network, peut ne pas être compatible avec d''autres plateformes de blockchain"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse in der Entwicklung von Solidity- und EVM-Smart-Verträgen","Spezifisch für das SKALE Network-Ökosystem, kann möglicherweise nicht mit anderen Blockchain-Plattformen kompatibel sein"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de desenvolvimento de contratos inteligentes Solidity e EVM","Específico do ecossistema da SKALE Network, pode não ser compatível com outras plataformas blockchain"],"ru":["Требует знаний в области разработки смарт-контрактов Solidity и EVM","Специфично для экосистемы сети SKALE Network и может быть несовместимо с другими блокчейн-платформами"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بتطوير العقود الذكية Solidity و EVM","خاص ببيئة شبكة SKALE Network، وقد لا يكون متوافقًا مع منصات blockchain أخرى"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"ac8f798c2f8b9de6a08874cac3791271b73d895f8d7f14b30a2fb37edf5288a0","qualityScore":50}');
DELETE FROM skills_fts WHERE id = 'TheGreatAxios/nft-marketplace-skale-agent-skill-build-claude-code/skale-dev';
INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('TheGreatAxios/nft-marketplace-skale-agent-skill-build-claude-code/skale-dev', 'skale-dev', 'TheGreatAxios', 'nft-marketplace-skale-agent-skill-build-claude-code', 'community', 'skale-dev TheGreatAxios nft-marketplace-skale-agent-skill-build-claude-code community The skale-dev skill provides a comprehensive development guide for SKALE Network, covering smart contracts, web/mobile integration, and cross-chain bridges. It benefits developers building on the SKALE ecosystem. SKALE 网络开发指南，涵盖 Solidity 和 EVM 智能合约、Web/Mobile 集成、跨链桥接和隐私原语等 SKALE ネットワーク開発のガイド。Solidity と EVM スマートコントラクト、Web/Mobile 統合、クロスチェーンブリッジ、プライバシープリミティブなど SKALE 네트워크 개발 가이드. 솔리디티 및 EVM 스마트 계약, 웹/모바일 통합, 크로스체인 브릿지, 프라이버시 원시 등 SKALE Network es una plataforma de desarrollo para crear aplicaciones descentralizadas con contratos inteligentes y privacidad avanzada SKALE Network est une plateforme de développement pour créer des applications décentralisées avec des contrats intelligents et une confidentialité avancée SKALE Network ist eine Entwicklungsumgebung für die Erstellung dezentraler Anwendungen mit Smart Contracts und erweiterter Privatsphäre O skale-dev é um guia de desenvolvimento abrangente para a rede SKALE, cobrindo smart contracts, integração web e mobile, pontes de cadeias cruzadas e primitivos de privacidade Skale-dev - это комплексное руководство по разработке для сети SKALE, охватывающее умные контракты, веб- и мобильную интеграцию, мосты между цепочками и примитивы конфиденциальности skale-dev هو دليل تطوير شامل لشبكة SKALE، يشمل العقود الذكية والتكامل مع الويب والجوال وجسور السلاسل المتقاطعة ومبادئ الخصوصية how to use skale-dev skale-dev setup guide SKALE Network development skale-dev vs Ethereum skale-dev alternative skale-dev install what is skale-dev SKALE Network smart contracts BITE Protocol integration SKALE 网络开发 智能合约 Web/Mobile 集成 跨链桥接 隐私原语 BITE Protocol SKALE 网络设置 SKALE 网络开发指南 Builds Solidity or EVM smart contracts for SKALE Integrates SKALE into web applications or dApps Deploys contracts to SKALE chains (Mainnet/Testnet/Sandbox) Builds private EVM applications with encrypted transactions using BITE Protocol Implements automated workflows for SKALE Network development skale-dev is a comprehensive development guide for SKALE Network, covering technical aspects such as smart contracts, web/mobile integration, and privacy primitives using BITE Protocol.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('wtyang/basic-antd-vite/ant-design', 'community', 'wtyang', 'basic-antd-vite', 'wtyang/basic-antd-vite', 'ant-design', 0, 0, 50, '2026-03-08T01:57:15.340Z', '2026-03-08T02:03:25.731Z', '3de78173aa90423d2b0e34ac82abf787b8ce260f92749f425ed970504fd48301', '{"id":"wtyang/basic-antd-vite/ant-design","name":"ant-design","description":{"en":"ant-design is a foundational framework for React-based admin projects, utilizing antd v6 and Vite. It benefits developers seeking efficient UI component management.","zh":"Ant Design 是一个基于 React 的后台管理项目基础架构，使用 Vite 作为构建工具","ja":"Ant Design は React を使用した後台管理プロジェクトの基本構成で、Vite をビルドツールとして使用","ko":"Ant Design는 React 기반의 백오피스 관리 프로젝트 기본 구조로 Vite를 빌드 도구로 사용합니다","es":"ant-design es una infraestructura básica para proyectos de administración de backend con React y Vite. Incluye componentes core, theming y tokens","fr":"ant-design est une infrastructure de base pour les projets de gestion de backend avec React et Vite. Il comprend des composants core, theming et tokens","de":"ant-design ist eine Basisinfrastruktur für Backend-Verwaltungsprojekte mit React und Vite. Enthält Core-Komponenten, Theming und Token","pt":"Ant Design é uma infraestrutura de projeto de administração baseada em React e Antd v6 com Vite","ru":"Ant Design - это базовая инфраструктура проекта администрирования на основе React и Antd v6 с Vite","ar":"Ant Design هو مشروع إدارة أساسي مبني على React و Antd v6 مع Vite"},"seo":{"title":{"en":"ant-design: Setup Guide for React 18-19 and Vite | AI Age...","zh":"Ant Design Setup Guide - 基于 React 和 Vite 的后台管理项目基础架构","ja":"Ant Design セットアップガイド - React と Vite を使用した後台管理プロジェクトの基本構成","ko":"Ant Design 설정 가이드 - React 및 Vite 기반의 백오피스 관리 프로젝트 기본 구조","es":"Guía de configuración de ant-design con React y Vite","fr":"Guide de mise en place d''ant-design avec React et Vite","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für ant-design mit React und Vite","pt":"Guia de Configuração do Ant Design para React","ru":"Настройка Ant Design для React: Лучшие Практики","ar":"إعداد أداة Ant Design لتحسين تجربة المستخدم"},"description":{"en":"Unlock efficient React development with ant-design. Learn how to leverage antd@^6, ant-design-pro@^5, and Vite for scalable UI components.","zh":"使用 Ant Design 和 React 构建高性能的后台管理项目，了解如何配置和优化您的应用","ja":"Ant Design と React を使用して高パフォーマンスの後台管理プロジェクトを構築する方法を学ぶ","ko":"Ant Design 및 React를 사용하여 고성능 백오피스 관리 프로젝트를 구축하는 방법에 대해 알아보세요","es":"Aprende a configurar ant-design con React 18-19 y Vite para crear aplicaciones de administración de backend robustas","fr":"Découvrez comment configurer ant-design avec React 18-19 et Vite pour créer des applications de gestion de backend solides","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie ant-design mit React 18-19 und Vite konfigurieren, um robuste Backend-Verwaltungsanwendungen zu erstellen","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o Ant Design para projetos React com TypeScript e Vite","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Настройка Ant Design для React с помощью TypeScript и Vite","ar":"تعلم كيفية إعداد أداة Ant Design لتحسين تجربة المستخدم مع React و TypeScript و Vite"},"definition":{"en":"ant-design is a React-based framework providing core components, theming, and CSS-in-JS capabilities for building scalable admin interfaces.","zh":"Ant Design 是一个基于 React 的 UI 组件库，提供了丰富的后台管理项目基础架构","ja":"Ant Design は React を使用した UI コンポーネントライブラリで、豊富な後台管理プロジェクトの基本構成を提供","ko":"Ant Design는 React 기반의 UI 컴포넌트 라이브러리로서豊富한 백오피스 관리 프로젝트 기본 구조를 제공합니다","es":"ant-design es un conjunto de componentes y herramientas para crear aplicaciones de administración de backend con React y Vite","fr":"ant-design est un ensemble de composants et d''outils pour créer des applications de gestion de backend avec React et Vite","de":"ant-design ist ein Satz von Komponenten und Tools zur Erstellung von Backend-Verwaltungsanwendungen mit React und Vite","pt":"O que é Ant Design? É uma infraestrutura de projeto de administração baseada em React","ru":"Что такое Ant Design? Это базовая инфраструктура проекта администрирования на основе React","ar":"ما هو Ant Design؟ هو مشروع إدارة أساسي مبني على React"},"features":{"en":["Supports core components and theming/tokens with antd@^6","Utilizes CSS-in-JS for styling with tokens","Enables Server-Side Rendering (SSR) for improved performance","Provides accessibility (a11y) features for compliant UI","Integrates with ant-design-pro@^5 for advanced layouts and routing","Includes X (AI/chat UI) patterns for enhanced user experience"],"zh":["基于 React 18-19 和 antd@^6","支持 ant-design-pro@^5 和 @ant-design/pro-components","提供核心组件、主题、CSS-in-JS、SSR、A11Y 和性能优化","支持 Pro 布局、路由、访问控制和 CRUD 操作","提供 X 模式（AI/聊天 UI 模式）"],"ja":["React 18-19 と antd@^6 を使用","ant-design-pro@^5 と @ant-design/pro-components をサポート","コアコンポーネント、テーマ、CSS-in-JS、SSR、A11Y、パフォーマンス最適化を提供","Pro レイアウト、ルーティング、ccess 制御、CRUD 操作をサポート","X パターン（AI/チャット UI パターン）を提供"],"ko":["React 18-19 및 antd@^6 기반","ant-design-pro@^5 및 @ant-design/pro-components 지원","코어 컴포넌트, 테마, CSS-in-JS, SSR, A11Y, 성능 최적화 제공","Pro 레이아웃, 라우팅, 액세스 제어, CRUD 연산 지원","X 패턴（AI/채팅 UI 패턴）제공"],"es":["Soporte para React 18-19","Integración con Vite","Componentes core y theming","Tokens y CSS-in-JS","Compatibilidad con SSR y a11y","Patrones de diseño de Pro y X"],"fr":["Prise en charge de React 18-19","Intégration avec Vite","Composants core et theming","Tokens et CSS-in-JS","Compatibilité avec SSR et a11y","Modèles de conception de Pro et X"],"de":["Unterstützung für React 18-19","Integration mit Vite","Core-Komponenten und Theming","Token und CSS-in-JS","Kompatibilität mit SSR und a11y","Entwurfsmuster von Pro und X"],"pt":["Componentes core do Ant Design","Temas e tokens de estilo","Suporte a CSS-in-JS","Renderização no lado do servidor (SSR)","Acessibilidade (a11y)"],"ru":["Ядро компонентов Ant Design","Темы и токены стиля","Поддержка CSS-in-JS","Рендеринг на стороне сервера (SSR)","Доступность (a11y)"],"ar":["مكونات أساسية من Ant Design","سمات وأساليب النمط","دعم CSS-in-JS","إعادة تحليل الجانب الخلفي (SSR)","إمكانية الوصول (a11y)"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use ant-design with React 18-19","ant-design vs material-ui","ant-design setup guide for Vite","what is ant-design and its benefits","ant-design alternative for admin interfaces","installing ant-design for scalable UI components","ant-design documentation and tutorials","ant-design pro components and their usage","ant-design and accessibility best practices"],"zh":["Ant Design","React","Vite","后台管理项目","UI 组件库","antd","ant-design-pro","CSS-in-JS","SSR","A11Y","性能优化"],"ja":["Ant Design","React","Vite","後台管理プロジェクト","UI コンポーネントライブラリ","antd","ant-design-pro","CSS-in-JS","SSR","A11Y","パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["Ant Design","React","Vite","백오피스 관리 프로젝트","UI 컴포넌트 라이브러리","antd","ant-design-pro","CSS-in-JS","SSR","A11Y","성능 최적화"],"es":["ant-design","React","Vite","administración de backend","componentes core","theming","tokens","CSS-in-JS","SSR","a11y","patrones de diseño de Pro y X"],"fr":["ant-design","React","Vite","gestion de backend","composants core","theming","tokens","CSS-in-JS","SSR","a11y","modèles de conception de Pro et X"],"de":["ant-design","React","Vite","Backend-Verwaltung","Core-Komponenten","Theming","Token","CSS-in-JS","SSR","a11y","Entwurfsmuster von Pro und X"],"pt":["Ant Design React","Configuração do Ant Design","TypeScript e Vite","Componentes core do Ant Design","Temas e tokens de estilo","CSS-in-JS","SSR","a11y"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты Ant Design","Настройка Ant Design для React","TypeScript и Vite","Ядро компонентов Ant Design","Темы и токены стиля","CSS-in-JS","SSR","a11y"],"ar":["أداة Ant Design لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","إعداد Ant Design لReact","TypeScript و Vite","مكونات أساسية من Ant Design","سمات وأساليب النمط","CSS-in-JS","إعادة تحليل الجانب الخلفي","إمكانية الوصول"]}},"owner":"wtyang","repo":"basic-antd-vite","repoPath":"wtyang/basic-antd-vite","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.340Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ant-design","description":"Ant Design ecosystem guidance covering antd 6.x, Ant Design Pro 5/ProComponents, and Ant Design X v2 (AI/chat UI). Use when making component/layout decisions, theming/tokens, SSR, routing/access, CRUD patterns, or AI chat UI integrations.","bodyPreview":"# Ant Design\n\n## S - Scope\n\n- Target: antd@^6 with React 18-19, plus ant-design-pro@^5 / @ant-design/pro-components and @ant-design/x@^2 when applicable.\n- Cover: core components, theming/tokens, css-in-js, SSR, a11y, performance, Pro layouts/routing/access/CRUD, and X (AI/chat UI) patterns.\n- Avoid: undocumented APIs, internal `.ant-*` class coupling, or cross-version mixing without explicit request.\n\n### Default assumptions (when not specified)\n\n- Language: TypeScript.\n- Styling: prefer tokens","body":"# Ant Design\n\n## S - Scope\n\n- Target: antd@^6 with React 18-19, plus ant-design-pro@^5 / @ant-design/pro-components and @ant-design/x@^2 when applicable.\n- Cover: core components, theming/tokens, css-in-js, SSR, a11y, performance, Pro layouts/routing/access/CRUD, and X (AI/chat UI) patterns.\n- Avoid: undocumented APIs, internal `.ant-*` class coupling, or cross-version mixing without explicit request.\n\n### Default assumptions (when not specified)\n\n- Language: TypeScript.\n- Styling: prefer tokens, `classNames`, and `styles`; avoid global overrides.\n- Provider: a single `ConfigProvider` at app root, unless isolation is required.\n- Dependencies: do not add new packages unless required or requested.\n\n### Scope rules (must follow)\n\n- Use only officially documented antd APIs and patterns.\n- Do not invent props, events, or component names.\n- Use only officially documented Pro/X APIs and patterns.\n- Assume v6 by default; do not mix v5 APIs unless explicitly requested.\n- Do not add global `.ant-*` overrides; prefer tokens and component tokens.\n- Keep examples short; no long, multi-screen samples in the main skill.\n- Do not rely on internal `.ant-*` classes or DOM details; if unavoidable, state risk and alternatives.\n- Theme priority is fixed: global tokens -> component tokens -> alias tokens.\n- For SSR, provide the minimal provider setup and verification points (hydration, style order, duplication).\n- Route complex issues to `Reference` files; main skill gives only decisions and entry points.\n\n### Complex triggers (must open a `Reference`)\n\n- More than 3 interaction states or cross-field linkage (Form).\n- Remote search, large data, or custom rendering (Select).\n- Server sorting/filtering/pagination, virtualization, fixed columns/headers (Table).\n- Async load, checkStrictly, or virtualization (Tree).\n- Controlled `fileList`, `customRequest`, preview/auth edge cases (Upload).\n- SSR style order, streaming/hydration errors, or performance bottlenecks.\n- Pro layouts, route-driven menus, or access control (Layout/Access).\n- ProTable/ProForm with request coupling, dynamic fields, or perf tuning.\n- X streaming, tool rendering, or Markdown extensions beyond the defaults.\n\n### `Reference` index (Chinese)\n\n| Topic           | Description                                          | `Reference`                           |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| Core v6         | Version scope, migration notes, theming/SSR overview | `references/antd-v6.md`               |\n| Legacy v5       | Existing v5 projects and migration guardrails        | `references/antd-v5.md`               |\n| Form advanced   | Dynamic forms, dependencies, validation perf         | `references/form-advanced.md`         |\n| Table advanced  | Sorting/filtering/virtualization patterns            | `references/table-advanced.md`        |\n| Upload advanced | Controlled upload, customRequest, edge cases         | `references/upload-advanced.md`       |\n| Select advanced | Remote search, tags, rendering and a11y              | `references/select-advanced.md`       |\n| Tree advanced   | Async load, checkStrictly, virtual                   | `references/tree-advanced.md`         |\n| Pro v5          | Pro 5 scope and baseline guidance                    | `references/pro-v5.md`                |\n| Pro layout      | Layouts, menus, access, multi-layout patterns        | `references/pro-layout-advanced.md`   |\n| ProTable        | Query/table coupling, request patterns, perf         | `references/protable-advanced.md`     |\n| ProForm         | Step forms, dynamic fields, table linkage            | `references/proform-advanced.md`      |\n| X v2            | X v2 scope and baseline guidance                     | `references/x-v2.md`                  |\n| X components    | Message/tool component patterns                      | `references/x-components-advanced.md` |\n| X SDK           | Streaming integration and state model                | `references/x-sdk-advanced.md`        |\n| X Markdown      | X Markdown extensions and rendering                  | `references/x-markdown-advanced.md`   |\n\n### Reference routing rule\n\n- Do not expand advanced topics in the main skill.\n- Jump to a `Reference` if any condition matches:\n  - More than 3 interaction states.\n  - Async flows or large data sets.\n  - Virtualization or performance tuning.\n  - Complex accessibility requirements.\n\n## P - Process\n\n### 1) Identify the layer first\n\n- Core antd UI, Pro admin app, or X chat/agent UI?\n- If Pro or X is involved, route to the relevant `Reference` when complexity triggers match.\n\n### 2) Clarify context before advising\n\n- Framework and rendering: Next.js / Umi / Vite? CSR / SSR / streaming?\n- antd version: confirm v6 if unclear.\n- Theming depth: small token changes or component-level overrides?\n- Data scale: large lists/tables/trees/selects?\n- Interaction complexity: controlled state, linkage, async, auth, upload flows?\n\n### 3) Provider minimal set\n\n- CSR: usually `ConfigProvider` only.\n- SSR or strict style order: add `StyleProvider` as per `references/antd-v6.md`.\n- One app, one root provider; local themes only for isolation needs.\n\n### 4) Component selection rules (core antd)\n\n- Form: prefer `Form` as source of truth unless external state is required.\n- Overlay: `Modal` for blocking flows; `Drawer` for side context or long content.\n- Lists: structured data uses `Table`, light lists use `List`; `Table` needs stable `rowKey`.\n- Large data: use virtualization (see `references/table-advanced.md`).\n- Select: local filter uses `filterOption`; remote search uses `showSearch` + `filterOption={false}` + `onSearch` (see `references/select-advanced.md`).\n- Upload: controlled flow uses `fileList`; complex flow uses `customRequest` (see `references/upload-advanced.md`).\n\n### 5) Pro decision shortcuts (when Pro is in scope)\n\n- Routes are the menu source of truth; avoid hand-built menus.\n- Access control is page-first; UI hides are secondary; backend still enforces.\n- CRUD uses ProTable/ProForm schemas as the source of truth (see Pro references).\n\n### 6) X decision shortcuts (when X is in scope)\n\n- Model messages/tools as serializable data; JSX is a pure view.\n- Streaming needs stable keys, throttled updates, and scroll management (see X references).\n\n### 7) Theming decision chain\n\n1. Use global tokens for most cases.\n2. Use component tokens or `classNames`/`styles` for differences.\n3. Only if unavoidable, use scoped CSS overrides and state the risk.\n4. Never rely on global `.ant-*` overrides.\n\n### 8) Shunt complexity to `Reference`\n\n- If any complex trigger matches, provide decision + minimal skeleton + `Reference` path.\n- Details live in the corresponding `references/*.md`.\n\n### 9) a11y and performance checks\n\n- a11y: keyboard access, focus management for overlays, icon buttons with `aria-label`, not color-only states.\n- perf: stable keys, memoized columns, avoid frequent setState, use virtualization and throttling as needed.\n\n## O - Output\n\n### Output should include (as needed)\n\n- Component and layout recommendations with 1-3 sentence rationale.\n- Minimal provider and theming strategy.\n- SSR, perf, and a11y risks with concrete mitigations.\n- Pro: route/layout plan, access model, and ProTable/ProForm schema when relevant.\n- X: message/tool schema and streaming state model when relevant.\n- A `Reference` path when complex triggers match.\n- Advice only (no code) when the request is selection or decision guidance.\n\n### Output forbidden\n\n- Inventing antd APIs, tokens, or relying on internal classes without calling out risk.\n- Replacing tokens with global CSS overrides.\n- Vague SSR/hydration advice without verification points.\n\n### Regression checklist (prefer 5-10 items)\n\n- [ ] Provider: one root `ConfigProvider`; SSR style order is controlled.\n- [ ] Theming: tokens first, no broad global `.ant-*` overrides.\n- [ ] Form: validation and linkage are within `Form` and reproducible.\n- [ ] Table: stable `rowKey`; pagination/sort/filter entry points are consistent.\n- [ ] Select: remote search disables local filter; a11y checks pass.\n- [ ] Upload: controlled vs uncontrolled mode is clear; failure and retry flows defined.\n- [ ] Overlays: close and destroy behavior is defined (`destroyOnClose` etc).\n- [ ] Performance: stable keys and memoization; virtualization or throttling when needed.\n- [ ] Pro: route-driven menus/access are consistent with backend enforcement.\n- [ ] X: streaming state, stop/retry, and tool rendering are deterministic.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:25.731Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents building efficient React-based admin projects with streamlined UI component management using ant-design and Vite.","zh":"适合用于构建高效的基于React的管理项目，具有简化的UI组件管理，使用ant-design和Vite。","ja":"Reactベースの管理プロジェクトを効率的に構築するために最適化されており、ant-designとViteを使用してUIコンポーネントの管理を簡素化しています。","ko":"React 기반의 관리 프로젝트를 효율적으로 구축하기에理想적이며, ant-design과 Vite를 사용하여 UI 컴포넌트 관리를 간소화합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Frontend que construyen proyectos de administración eficientes basados en React con una gestión de componentes de interfaz de usuario optimizada utilizando ant-design y Vite.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend qui créent des projets d''administration efficaces basés sur React avec une gestion de composants d''interface utilisateur rationalisée en utilisant ant-design et Vite.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die effiziente React-basierte Admin-Projekte mit optimierter UI-Komponentenverwaltung mithilfe von ant-design und Vite erstellen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que constroem projetos administrativos eficientes baseados em React com gestão de componentes de interface de usuário otimizados usando ant-design e Vite.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, создающих эффективные административные проекты на основе React с упрощенным управлением компонентами интерфейса пользователя, используя ant-design и Vite.","ar":"مثالية لوسائل وكلاء الواجهة الأمامية التي تبني مشاريع إدارية فعالة قائمة على React مع إدارة مكونات واجهة المستخدم المُتدفقة باستخدام ant-design و Vite."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage antd v6, theming/tokens, css-in-js, SSR, a11y, and performance optimizations, while utilizing Pro layouts, routing, access, and CRUD operations, all integrated with X patterns for AI/chat UI.","zh":"赋予代理商利用antd v6、主题/令牌、css-in-js、SSR、a11y和性能优化的能力，同时利用Pro布局、路由、访问和CRUD操作，全部集成X模式以实现AI/聊天UI。","ja":"antd v6、テーマ/トークン、css-in-js、SSR、a11y、パフォーマンス最適化を利用し、Proレイアウト、ルーティング、接続、CRUD操作を利用して、Xパターンを使用したAI/チャットUIを実現します。","ko":"antd v6, 테마/토큰, css-in-js, SSR, a11y 및 성능 최적화를 활용할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, Pro 레이아웃, 라우팅, 접근 및 CRUD 작업을 모두 X 패턴과 함께 통합하여 AI/채팅 UI를 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar antd v6, theming/tokens, css-in-js, SSR, a11y y optimizaciones de rendimiento, mientras utilizan diseños Pro, enrutamiento, acceso y operaciones CRUD, todo integrado con patrones X para la interfaz de usuario de AI/chat.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter antd v6, theming/tokens, css-in-js, SSR, a11y et optimisations de performances, tout en utilisant des dispositions Pro, routage, accès et opérations CRUD, le tout intégré avec des modèles X pour l''interface utilisateur de l''IA/discussion.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, antd v6, theming/tokens, css-in-js, SSR, a11y und Leistungsoptimierungen zu nutzen, während sie Pro-Layouts, Routing, Zugriff und CRUD-Operationen verwenden, all dies integriert mit X-Mustern für die Benutzeroberfläche von KI/Chat.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar antd v6, theming/tokens, css-in-js, SSR, a11y e otimizações de desempenho, ao mesmo tempo em que utiliza layouts Pro, roteamento, acesso e operações CRUD, todas integradas com padrões X para UI de IA/chat.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность использовать antd v6, theming/tokens, css-in-js, SSR, a11y и оптимизации производительности, а также использовать макеты Pro, маршрутизацию, доступ и операции CRUD, все интегрированные с шаблонами X для UI ИИ/чата.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من antd v6 و theming/tokens و css-in-js و SSR و a11y وتحسينات الأداء، مع استخدام تخطيطات Pro وتنقل ووصول وعمليات CRUD، جميعها متكاملة مع أنماط X لواجهة المستخدم الذكية/الدردشة."},"useCases":{"en":["Building responsive and accessible admin dashboards with ant-design-pro","Streamlining UI component management with antd v6 and Vite","Implementing SSR and performance optimizations for React-based projects","Utilizing X patterns for integrating AI/chat UI components"],"zh":["使用ant-design-pro构建响应式和无障碍管理仪表盘","使用antd v6和Vite简化UI组件管理","为React基于项目实现SSR和性能优化","利用X模式集成AI/聊天UI组件"],"ja":["ant-design-proを使用してレスポンシブでアクセシブルな管理ダッシュボードを構築する","antd v6とViteを使用してUIコンポーネントの管理を簡素化する","ReactベースのプロジェクトでSSRとパフォーマンス最適化を実現する","Xパターンを使用してAI/チャットUIコンポーネントを統合する"],"ko":["ant-design-pro를 사용하여 반응형 및 접근 가능한 관리 대시보드를 구축하는 것","antd v6 및 Vite를 사용하여 UI 컴포넌트 관리를 간소화하는 것","React 기반 프로젝트에서 SSR 및 성능 최적화를 구현하는 것","X 패턴을 사용하여 AI/채팅 UI 컴포넌트를 통합하는 것"],"es":["Crear paneles de administración responsivos y accesibles con ant-design-pro","Racionalizar la gestión de componentes de interfaz de usuario con antd v6 y Vite","Implementar SSR y optimizaciones de rendimiento para proyectos basados en React","Utilizar patrones X para integrar componentes de interfaz de usuario de AI/chat"],"fr":["Créer des tableaux de bord d''administration responsifs et accessibles avec ant-design-pro","Rationaliser la gestion des composants d''interface utilisateur avec antd v6 et Vite","Mettre en œuvre SSR et optimisations de performances pour les projets basés sur React","Utiliser des modèles X pour intégrer des composants d''interface utilisateur de l''IA/discussion"],"de":["Erstellen von responsiven und zugänglichen Admin-Dashboards mit ant-design-pro","Optimieren der Verwaltung von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit antd v6 und Vite","Implementieren von SSR und Leistungsoptimierungen für React-basierte Projekte","Verwenden von X-Mustern zur Integration von KI/Chat-Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten"],"pt":["Construção de painéis de administração responsivos e acessíveis com ant-design-pro","Otimização da gestão de componentes de interface de usuário com antd v6 e Vite","Implementação de SSR e otimizações de desempenho para projetos baseados em React","Utilização de padrões X para integração de componentes de UI de IA/chat"],"ru":["Создание отзывчивых и доступных административных панелей с ant-design-pro","Упрощение управления компонентами интерфейса пользователя с antd v6 и Vite","Реализация SSR и оптимизаций производительности для проектов на основе React","Использование шаблонов X для интеграции компонентов UI ИИ/чата"],"ar":["بناء لوحات تحكم إدارية متجاوبة وقابلة للوصول مع ant-design-pro","تسهيل إدارة مكونات واجهة المستخدم مع antd v6 و Vite","تنفيذ SSR وتحسينات الأداء لمشاريع قائمة على React","استخدام أنماط X لتكامل مكونات واجهة المستخدم الذكية/الدردشة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React 18-19 and antd@^6","Avoids undocumented APIs and internal `.ant-*` class coupling","Limited to specific versions of ant-design-pro and @ant-design/x"],"zh":["需要React 18-19和antd@^6","避免未记录的API和内部`.ant-*`类耦合","仅限于ant-design-pro和@ant-design/x的特定版本"],"ja":["React 18-19とantd@^6が必要","未記載のAPIと内部`.ant-*`クラス結合を避ける","ant-design-proと@ant-design/xの特定のバージョンに限定される"],"ko":["React 18-19 및 antd@^6가 필요","기록되지 않은 API 및 내부 `.ant-*` 클래스 결합을 피함","ant-design-pro 및 @ant-design/x의 특정 버전에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere React 18-19 y antd@^6","Evita APIs no documentadas y acoplamiento interno de clases `.ant-*`","Limitado a versiones específicas de ant-design-pro y @ant-design/x"],"fr":["Nécessite React 18-19 et antd@^6","Évite les API non documentées et le couplage interne de classes `.ant-*`","Limité à des versions spécifiques de ant-design-pro et @ant-design/x"],"de":["Benötigt React 18-19 und antd@^6","Vermeidet nicht dokumentierte APIs und interne `.ant-*`-Klassenkopplung","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Versionen von ant-design-pro und @ant-design/x"],"pt":["Exige React 18-19 e antd@^6","Evita APIs não documentadas e acoplamento de classes internas `.ant-*`","Limitado a versões específicas de ant-design-pro e @ant-design/x"],"ru":["Требует React 18-19 и antd@^6","Избегает недокументированных API и внутреннего связывания классов `.ant-*`","Ограничен конкретными версиями ant-design-pro и @ant-design/x"],"ar":["يتطلب React 18-19 و antd@^6","يتجنب واجهات برمجة التطبيقات غير المocumentedة والربط الداخلي للفئات `.ant-*`","محدود بطرازات محددة من ant-design-pro و @ant-design/x"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"3de78173aa90423d2b0e34ac82abf787b8ce260f92749f425ed970504fd48301","qualityScore":50}');
