nd modern PHP 8.2+ development for administrative and commercial management applications.","zh":"Laravel Specialist 是一名高级 Laravel 工程师，专门从事 Laravel 10+ 应用开发","ja":"Laravel Specialist は、Laravel 10+ アプリケーション開発を専門とするシニア Laravel エンジニアです","ko":"Laravel Specialist는 Laravel 10+ 애플리케이션 개발을 전문으로 하는 시니어 Laravel 엔지니어입니다","es":"Un especialista en Laravel es un ingeniero senior con experiencia en desarrollo de aplicaciones con Laravel 10+ y Eloquent ORM","fr":"Un spécialiste Laravel est un ingénieur senior avec une expérience en développement d''applications avec Laravel 10+ et Eloquent ORM","de":"Ein Laravel-Spezialist ist ein Senior-Ingenieur mit Erfahrung in der Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit Laravel 10+ und Eloquent ORM","pt":"O que é Laravel Specialist? É um especialista sênior em Laravel com experiência em Eloquent ORM e PHP 8.2+.","ru":"Что такое ИИ Агент Laravel Specialist? Это старший специалист по Laravel с опытом работы с Eloquent ORM и PHP 8.2+.","ar":"ما هو Laravel Specialist? هو محترف أول في Laravel ذو خبرة في Eloquent ORM و PHP 8.2+."},"features":{"en":["Builds elegant, scalable Laravel 10+ applications","Implements Eloquent models and API resources","Utilizes queue systems for efficient task management","Develops with modern PHP 8.2+ and Laravel patterns","Creates powerful features for administrative and commercial management"],"zh":["Laravel 10+ 应用开发","Eloquent ORM 集成","现代 PHP 8.2+ 开发","API 资源支持","队列系统集成"],"ja":["Laravel 10+ アプリケーション開発","Eloquent ORM 統合","modern PHP 8.2+ 開発","API リソースサポート","キュー システム統合"],"ko":["Laravel 10+ 애플리케이션 개발","Eloquent ORM 통합","현대적인 PHP 8.2+ 개발","API 리소스 지원","큐 시스템 통합"],"es":["Desarrollo de aplicaciones con Laravel 10+","Implementación de modelos Eloquent","Uso de API resources y sistemas de cola","Desarrollo con PHP 8.2+","Integración de patrones modernos de Laravel"],"fr":["Développement d''applications avec Laravel 10+","Mise en place de modèles Eloquent","Utilisation de ressources API et de systèmes de file d''attente","Développement avec PHP 8.2+","Intégration de patrons modernes de Laravel"],"de":["Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit Laravel 10+","Implementierung von Eloquent-Modellen","Verwendung von API-Ressourcen und Warteschlangensystemen","Entwicklung mit PHP 8.2+","Integration moderner Laravel-Muster"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicações Laravel 10+","Implementação de modelos Eloquent","Utilização de recursos de API","Sistemas de fila","Padrões modernos de Laravel"],"ru":["Разработка приложений Laravel 10+","Реализация моделей Eloquent","Использование ресурсов API","Системы очередей","Современные паттерны Laravel"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات Laravel 10+","تنفيذ نماذج Eloquent","استخدام موارد API","نظم الطوابير","أنماط Laravel الحديثة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use laravel-specialist","what is laravel-specialist","laravel-specialist alternative","laravel-specialist vs lumen","laravel-specialist install guide","laravel-specialist setup for legal consulting firms","expert laravel 10+ development","eloquent orm tutorial","php 8.2+ development best practices"],"zh":["Laravel Specialist","Laravel 10+","Eloquent ORM","现代 PHP 8.2+","API 资源","队列系统","AIエージェント"],"ja":["Laravel Specialist","Laravel 10+","Eloquent ORM","modern PHP 8.2+","API リソース","キュー システム","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Laravel Specialist","Laravel 10+","Eloquent ORM","현대적인 PHP 8.2+","API 리소스","큐 시스템","인공지능 에이전트"],"es":["Laravel 10+","Eloquent ORM","PHP 8.2+","desarrollo de aplicaciones","gestión administrativa","gestión comercial","Herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","Agentes de AI para Laravel"],"fr":["Laravel 10+","Eloquent ORM","PHP 8.2+","développement d''applications","gestion administrative","gestion commerciale","Outils d''IA pour développeurs","Agents d''IA pour Laravel"],"de":["Laravel 10+","Eloquent ORM","PHP 8.2+","Anwendungsentwicklung","administrative Verwaltung","kommerzielle Verwaltung","KI-Tools für Entwickler","KI-Agents für Laravel"],"pt":["Laravel Specialist","Eloquent ORM","PHP 8.2+","Desenvolvimento de aplicações Laravel","Implementação de modelos Eloquent","Recursos de API","Sistemas de fila","Padrões modernos de Laravel"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Laravel Specialist","Eloquent ORM","PHP 8.2+","Разработка приложений Laravel","Реализация моделей Eloquent","Ресурсы API","Системы очередей","Современные паттерны Laravel"],"ar":["Laravel Specialist","Eloquent ORM","PHP 8.2+","تطوير تطبيقات Laravel","تنفيذ نماذج Eloquent","موارد API","نظم الطوابير","أنماط Laravel الحديثة"]}},"owner":"danieledelgiudice","repo":"shiny-disco","repoPath":"danieledelgiudice/shiny-disco","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.341Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"laravel-specialist","description":"Use when building Laravel 10+ applications requiring Eloquent ORM, API resources, or queue systems. Invoke for Laravel models, Livewire components, Sanctum authentication, Horizon queues.","bodyPreview":"# Laravel Specialist\n\nSenior Laravel specialist with deep expertise in Laravel 10+, Eloquent ORM, and modern PHP 8.2+ development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior PHP engineer with 10+ years of Laravel experience. You specialize in Laravel 10+ with PHP 8.2+, Eloquent ORM, API resources, queue systems, and modern Laravel patterns. You build elegant, scalable applications with powerful features.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Laravel 10+ applications\n- Implementing Eloquent models an","body":"# Laravel Specialist\n\nSenior Laravel specialist with deep expertise in Laravel 10+, Eloquent ORM, and modern PHP 8.2+ development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior PHP engineer with 10+ years of Laravel experience. You specialize in Laravel 10+ with PHP 8.2+, Eloquent ORM, API resources, queue systems, and modern Laravel patterns. You build elegant, scalable applications with powerful features.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Laravel 10+ applications\n- Implementing Eloquent models and relationships\n- Creating RESTful APIs with API resources\n- Setting up queue systems and jobs\n- Building reactive interfaces with Livewire\n- Implementing authentication with Sanctum\n- Optimizing database queries and performance\n- Writing comprehensive tests with Pest/PHPUnit\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Identify models, relationships, APIs, queue needs\n2. **Design architecture** - Plan database schema, service layers, job queues\n3. **Implement models** - Create Eloquent models with relationships, scopes, casts\n4. **Build features** - Develop controllers, services, API resources, jobs\n5. **Test thoroughly** - Write feature and unit tests with >85% coverage\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Eloquent ORM | `references/eloquent.md` | Models, relationships, scopes, query optimization |\n| Routing & APIs | `references/routing.md` | Routes, controllers, middleware, API resources |\n| Queue System | `references/queues.md` | Jobs, workers, Horizon, failed jobs, batching |\n| Livewire | `references/livewire.md` | Components, wire:model, actions, real-time |\n| Testing | `references/testing.md` | Feature tests, factories, mocking, Pest PHP |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use PHP 8.2+ features (readonly, enums, typed properties)\n- Type hint all method parameters and return types\n- Use Eloquent relationships properly (avoid N+1)\n- Implement API resources for transforming data\n- Queue long-running tasks\n- Write comprehensive tests (>85% coverage)\n- Use service containers and dependency injection\n- Follow PSR-12 coding standards\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use raw queries without protection (SQL injection)\n- Skip eager loading (causes N+1 problems)\n- Store sensitive data unencrypted\n- Mix business logic in controllers\n- Hardcode configuration values\n- Skip validation on user input\n- Use deprecated Laravel features\n- Ignore queue failures\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing Laravel features, provide:\n1. Model file (Eloquent model with relationships)\n2. Migration file (database schema)\n3. Controller/API resource (if applicable)\n4. Service class (business logic)\n5. Test file (feature/unit tests)\n6. Brief explanation of design decisions\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nLaravel 10+, Eloquent ORM, PHP 8.2+, API resources, Sanctum/Passport, queues, Horizon, Livewire, Inertia, Octane, Pest/PHPUnit, Redis, broadcasting, events/listeners, notifications, task scheduling\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **Fullstack Guardian** - Full-stack Laravel features\n- **Test Master** - Comprehensive testing strategies\n- **DevOps Engineer** - Laravel deployment and CI/CD\n- **Security Reviewer** - Laravel security audits\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:28.018Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for PHP-focused AI Agents seeking advanced Laravel framework expertise for scalable web application development.","zh":"适合专注于PHP的AI代理，寻求高级Laravel框架专业知识以进行可扩展的Web应用程序开发。","ja":"PHPに焦点を当てたAIエージェントが、スケーラブルなWebアプリケーション開発のために高度なLaravelフレームワークの専門知識を求める場合に適しています。","ko":"PHP에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트가 확장 가능한 웹 애플리케이션 개발을 위해 고급 Laravel 프레임워크 전문 지식을 찾는 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA enfocados en PHP que buscan experiencia avanzada en el framework Laravel para el desarrollo de aplicaciones web escalables.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur PHP qui recherchent une expertise avancée sur le framework Laravel pour le développement d''applications web évolutives.","de":"Ideal für PHP-fokussierte KI-Agents, die erweiterte Laravel-Framework-Expertenwissen für die Entwicklung von skalierbaren Webanwendungen suchen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados em PHP que buscam especialização avançada em framework Laravel para desenvolvimento de aplicações web escaláveis.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на PHP, которые стремятся получить углубленные знания в области фреймворка Laravel для разработки масштабируемых веб-приложений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكية المتخصصة في PHP الذين يبحثون عن خبرة متقدمة في إطار Laravel من أجل تطوير تطبيقات الويب القابلة للتوسيع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build elegant, scalable Laravel 10+ applications with Eloquent ORM, leveraging modern PHP 8.2+ development principles, API resources, and queue systems for robust feature implementation.","zh":"赋予代理构建优雅、可扩展的Laravel 10+应用程序的能力，利用Eloquent ORM、现代PHP 8.2+开发原则、API资源和队列系统实现强大的功能。","ja":"エージェントがEloquent ORM、現代のPHP 8.2+開発原則、APIリソース、キュー システムを利用して、優雅でスケーラブルなLaravel 10+アプリケーションを構築する能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 Eloquent ORM, 현대의 PHP 8.2+ 개발 원칙, API 리소스, 큐 시스템을 활용하여 우아하고 확장 가능한 Laravel 10+ 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones Laravel 10+ elegantes y escalables con Eloquent ORM, aprovechando principios de desarrollo modernos de PHP 8.2+, recursos de API y sistemas de cola para una implementación robusta de características.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications Laravel 10+ élégantes et évolutives avec Eloquent ORM, en exploitant les principes de développement modernes de PHP 8.2+, les ressources d''API et les systèmes de file d''attente pour une mise en œuvre robuste des fonctionnalités.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, elegante, skalierbare Laravel 10+-Anwendungen mit Eloquent ORM zu erstellen, indem moderne PHP 8.2+-Entwicklungsprinzipien, API-Ressourcen und Warteschlangensysteme für eine robuste Funktionsimplementierung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações Laravel 10+ elegantes e escaláveis com Eloquent ORM, aproveitando princípios modernos de desenvolvimento PHP 8.2+, recursos de API e sistemas de fila para implementação robusta de recursos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать элегантные и масштабируемые приложения Laravel 10+ с Eloquent ORM, используя современные принципы разработки PHP 8.2+, ресурсы API и системы очередей для надежной реализации функций.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات Laravel 10+ أنيقة وقابلة للتوسيع مع Eloquent ORM، مستفيدة من مبدأ التطوير الحديث PHP 8.2+ وموارد API وأنظمة التصفية من أجل تنفيذ ميزات قوية."},"useCases":{"en":["Building scalable Laravel 10+ applications with Eloquent ORM","Implementing efficient Eloquent models and API resources","Developing modern Laravel patterns for powerful web applications"],"zh":["构建使用Eloquent ORM的可扩展Laravel 10+应用程序","实现高效的Eloquent模型和API资源","开发用于强大的Web应用程序的现代Laravel模式"],"ja":["Eloquent ORMを使用したスケーラブルなLaravel 10+アプリケーションの構築","効率的なEloquentモデルとAPIリソースの実装","強力なWebアプリケーション用の現代のLaravelパターンの開発"],"ko":["Eloquent ORM을 사용하는 확장 가능한 Laravel 10+ 애플리케이션 구축","효율적인 Eloquent 모델 및 API 리소스 구현","강력한 웹 애플리케이션을 위한 현대의 Laravel 패턴 개발"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones Laravel 10+ escalables con Eloquent ORM","Implementación de modelos Eloquent y recursos de API eficientes","Desarrollo de patrones modernos de Laravel para aplicaciones web potentes"],"fr":["Création d''applications Laravel 10+ évolutives avec Eloquent ORM","Mise en œuvre de modèles Eloquent et de ressources d''API efficaces","Développement de modèles modernes de Laravel pour des applications web puissantes"],"de":["Erstellung von skalierbaren Laravel 10+-Anwendungen mit Eloquent ORM","Implementierung effizienter Eloquent-Modelle und API-Ressourcen","Entwicklung moderner Laravel-Muster für leistungsstarke Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Construção de aplicações Laravel 10+ escaláveis com Eloquent ORM","Implementação de modelos Eloquent eficientes e recursos de API","Desenvolvimento de padrões modernos Laravel para aplicações web poderosas"],"ru":["Создание масштабируемых приложений Laravel 10+ с Eloquent ORM","Реализация эффективных моделей Eloquent и ресурсов API","Разработка современных шаблонов Laravel для мощных веб-приложений"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات Laravel 10+ قابلة للتوسيع مع Eloquent ORM","تنفيذ نماذج Eloquent فعالة وموارد API","تطوير أنماط Laravel الحديثة لتطبيقات الويب القوية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PHP 8.2+ compatibility","Limited to Laravel 10+ framework","Experienced PHP engineer expertise necessary"],"zh":["需要PHP 8.2+兼容性","仅限Laravel 10+框架","需要经验丰富的PHP工程师专业知识"],"ja":["PHP 8.2+の互換性が必要","Laravel 10+フレームワークに限定される","経験豊富なPHPエンジニアの専門知識が必要"],"ko":["PHP 8.2+ 호환성이 필요함","Laravel 10+ 프레임워크에만 제한됨","経験豊富한 PHP 엔지니어의 전문 지식이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con PHP 8.2+","Limitado al framework Laravel 10+","Se requiere experiencia en ingeniería de PHP"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec PHP 8.2+","Limité au framework Laravel 10+","L''expertise d''un ingénieur PHP expérimenté est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt PHP 8.2+-Kompatibilität","Begrenzt auf Laravel 10+-Framework","Erfahrung eines erfahrenen PHP-Ingenieurs erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com PHP 8.2+","Limitado ao framework Laravel 10+","Necessário conhecimento de engenheiro experiente em PHP"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с PHP 8.2+","Ограничен фреймворком Laravel 10+","Требуется опытный инженер-программист по PHP"],"ar":["يتطلب التوافق مع PHP 8.2+","محدود بإطار Laravel 10+","يتطلب خبرة مهندس متمرس في PHP"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"5e85c1de4e904e51d620eb680c7069b4041fc3321c3c5c4d9122007877d930e9","qualityScore":50}');
