requests","Suchmaschinenoptimierung für Russland und die GUS"],"pt":["Yandex Competitive Analysis","análise de concorrentes","otimização de busca","mercados de busca russos","CIS","mcp__yandex-search__search","mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","Yandex Competitive Analysis","анализ конкурентов","оптимизация поиска","российские рынки поиска","СНГ","mcp__yandex-search__search","mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests"],"ar":["أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي","تحليل المنافس ياندكس","تحليل المنافسين","تحسين البحث","الأسواق البحثية الروسية","السي آي إس","mcp__yandex-search__search","mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests"]}},"owner":"altrr2","repo":"yandex-tools-mcp","repoPath":"altrr2/yandex-tools-mcp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.353Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"yandex-competitive-analysis","description":"Analyze competitors and search landscape in Russian/CIS markets using Yandex tools. Finds who ranks for keywords, identifies content gaps, and discovers ranking opportunities. Use when user asks about competitors, who ranks for something, content gaps, or SERP analysis in Russia/CIS.","bodyPreview":"# Yandex Competitive Analysis\n\nAnalyze competitors and find opportunities in Russian and CIS search markets.\n\n## Available Tools\n\n- `mcp__yandex-search__search` - Find who currently ranks for target keywords\n- `mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests` - Understand search volume and related queries\n- `mcp__yandex-wordstat__dynamics` - Track if competition is increasing over time\n- `mcp__yandex-wordstat__regions` - Find underserved regional markets\n- `mcp__yandex-webmaster__get-popular-queries` - Compa","body":"# Yandex Competitive Analysis\n\nAnalyze competitors and find opportunities in Russian and CIS search markets.\n\n## Available Tools\n\n- `mcp__yandex-search__search` - Find who currently ranks for target keywords\n- `mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests` - Understand search volume and related queries\n- `mcp__yandex-wordstat__dynamics` - Track if competition is increasing over time\n- `mcp__yandex-wordstat__regions` - Find underserved regional markets\n- `mcp__yandex-webmaster__get-popular-queries` - Compare user''s site performance (requires Webmaster)\n- `mcp__yandex-webmaster__get-summary` - Get user''s site health metrics (requires Webmaster)\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Search landscape**: Use `search` to find top 10-20 results for target keywords\n2. **Volume analysis**: Use `top-requests` to understand search demand\n3. **Trend analysis**: Use `dynamics` to see if market is growing\n4. **Regional opportunities**: Use `regions` to find high-affinity, underserved regions\n5. **Own position** (if Webmaster): Compare user''s ranking vs competitors\n\n## Analysis Framework\n\nWhen analyzing competitors:\n- **Domain authority signals**: Identify recurring domains in top positions\n- **Content patterns**: Note content types that rank (articles, products, forums)\n- **Gap opportunities**: Keywords with high volume but weak competition\n- **Regional gaps**: Regions with high affinity but low competition\n\n## Output Guidelines\n\n- Adapt output language to match the user''s language\n- Present competitor domains with their ranking positions\n- Highlight content gaps and opportunities clearly\n- Provide actionable recommendations\n- Include regional opportunities if relevant\n\n## Example Queries That Trigger This Skill\n\n- \"Who ranks for [keyword] in Yandex?\"\n- \"Analyze competitors for [topic] in Russia\"\n- \"What content gaps exist for [topic]?\"\n- \"SERP analysis for [keyword]\"\n- \"Find ranking opportunities for [topic]\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:55.636Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SEO Agents needing advanced Yandex search market analysis capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级Yandex搜索市场分析功能的SEO代理。","ja":"Yandex検索市場の高度な分析機能を必要とするSEOエージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 Yandex 검색 시장 분석 기능이 필요한 SEO 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de SEO que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de análisis de mercado de búsqueda de Yandex.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents SEO ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''analyse de marché de recherche Yandex.","de":"Perfekt für SEO-Agenten, die erweiterte Yandex-Suchmarktanalysefunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de SEO que precisam de capacidades avançadas de análise de mercado de busca do Yandex.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов SEO, которым необходимы расширенные возможности анализа поискового рынка Yandex.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تحسين محركات البحث الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحليل سوق بحث ياندكس."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze competitors and find opportunities in Russian and CIS search markets using tools like mcp__yandex-search__search and mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests, providing insights into search volume, related queries, and regional market trends.","zh":"赋予代理分析竞争对手并在俄罗斯和CIS搜索市场中找到机会，使用像mcp__yandex-search__search和mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests这样的工具，提供对搜索量、相关查询和区域市场趋势的洞察。","ja":"エージェントが競合他社を分析し、mcp__yandex-search__searchやmcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requestsなどのツールを使用してロシアとCISの検索市場で機会を発見し、検索ボリューム、関連クエリ、地域市場のトレンドに関する洞察を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 경쟁자를 분석하고 mcp__yandex-search__search 및 mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests와 같은 도구를 사용하여 러시아 및 CIS 검색 시장에서 기회를 찾을 수 있도록 하며, 검색 볼륨, 관련 쿼리 및 지역 시장 트렌드에 대한 통찰력을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes analizar a los competidores y encontrar oportunidades en los mercados de búsqueda rusos y de la CEI utilizando herramientas como mcp__yandex-search__search y mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests, lo que proporciona información sobre el volumen de búsqueda, consultas relacionadas y tendencias del mercado regional.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les concurrents et de trouver des opportunités sur les marchés de recherche russes et de la CEI en utilisant des outils tels que mcp__yandex-search__search et mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests, fournissant des informations sur le volume de recherche, les requêtes liées et les tendances du marché régional.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Wettbewerber zu analysieren und Chancen in den russischen und GUS-Suchmärkten mit Tools wie mcp__yandex-search__search und mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests zu finden, um Einblicke in die Suchvolumina, verwandte Abfragen und regionale Markttrends zu gewinnen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes analisem concorrentes e encontrem oportunidades nos mercados de busca russos e da CEI, utilizando ferramentas como mcp__yandex-search__search e mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests, fornecendo informações sobre volume de busca, consultas relacionadas e tendências de mercado regionais.","ru":"Позволяет агентам анализировать конкурентов и находить возможности на российском и рынках СНГ, используя инструменты như mcp__yandex-search__search и mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests, предоставляя информацию о объеме поиска, связанных запросах и региональных рыночных тенденциях.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من خلالها تحلیل المنافسين وإیجاد الفرص في أسواق البحث الروسية والسي آي إس، باستخدام أدوات مثل mcp__yandex-search__search و mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests، مما يوفر معلومات حول حجم البحث والاستفسارات ذات الصلة واتجاهات السوق الإقليمية."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing competitors'' keyword rankings with mcp__yandex-search__search","Tracking search volume and related queries with mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests","Identifying underserved regional markets with mcp__yandex-wordstat__regions"],"zh":["使用mcp__yandex-search__search分析竞争对手的关键词排名","使用mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests跟踪搜索量和相关查询","使用mcp__yandex-wordstat__regions识别服务不足的区域市场"],"ja":["mcp__yandex-search__searchを使用して競合他社のキーワードランキングを分析する","mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requestsを使用して検索ボリュームと関連クエリを追跡する","mcp__yandex-wordstat__regionsを使用してサービス不足の地域市場を特定する"],"ko":["mcp__yandex-search__search를 사용하여 경쟁자의 키워드 순위를 분석합니다.","mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests를 사용하여 검색 볼륨과 관련 쿼리를 추적합니다.","mcp__yandex-wordstat__regions를 사용하여 서비스가 부족한 지역 시장을 식별합니다."],"es":["Análisis de los rankings de palabras clave de los competidores con mcp__yandex-search__search","Seguimiento del volumen de búsqueda y consultas relacionadas con mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests","Identificación de mercados regionales insuficientemente atendidos con mcp__yandex-wordstat__regions"],"fr":["Analyse des classements des mots-clés des concurrents avec mcp__yandex-search__search","Suivi du volume de recherche et des requêtes liées avec mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests","Identification des marchés régionaux insuffisamment desservis avec mcp__yandex-wordstat__regions"],"de":["Analyse der Keyword-Rankings der Wettbewerber mit mcp__yandex-search__search","Verfolgung des Suchvolumens und verwandter Abfragen mit mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests","Identifizierung von regionalen Märkten mit unzureichender Versorgung mit mcp__yandex-wordstat__regions"],"pt":["Analisar classificações de palavras-chave dos concorrentes com mcp__yandex-search__search","Acompanhar volume de busca e consultas relacionadas com mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests","Identificar mercados regionais subatendidos com mcp__yandex-wordstat__regions"],"ru":["Анализировать рейтинги ключевых слов конкурентов с помощью mcp__yandex-search__search","Отслеживать объем поиска и связанные запросы с помощью mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests","Определять недооцененные региональные рынки с помощью mcp__yandex-wordstat__regions"],"ar":["تحلیل تصنيفات الكلمات الرئيسية للمنافسين باستخدام mcp__yandex-search__search","تتبع حجم البحث والاستفسارات ذات الصلة باستخدام mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests","تحديد الأسواق الإقليمية غير الملبية باستخدام mcp__yandex-wordstat__regions"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to Russian and CIS search markets","Requires access to Yandex search and wordstat tools"],"zh":["仅限于俄罗斯和CIS搜索市场","需要访问Yandex搜索和wordstat工具"],"ja":["ロシアとCISの検索市場のみに限定されている","Yandex検索とwordstatツールへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["러시아 및 CIS 검색 시장에만 제한됩니다.","Yandex 검색 및 wordstat 도구에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다."],"es":["Limitado a los mercados de búsqueda rusos y de la CEI","Requiere acc