INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('altrr2/yandex-tools-mcp/yandex-competitive-analysis', 'yandex-competitive-analysis', 'altrr2', 'yandex-tools-mcp', 'community', 'yandex-competitive-analysis altrr2 yandex-tools-mcp community yandex-competitive-analysis helps developers analyze competitors and find opportunities in Russian and CIS search markets by utilizing tools like mcp__yandex-search__search and mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests. Yandex 竞争分析工具帮助开发者分析俄罗斯和 CIS 搜索市场，找到商业机会。利用 mcp__yandex-search__search 等工具 Yandex 競合分析ツールは、開発者がロシアとCISの検索市場を分析し、ビジネスチャンスを発見するのに役立ちます。mcp__yandex-search__search 等のツールを使用 Yandex 경쟁 분석 도구는 개발자가 러시아 및 CIS 검색 시장 분석하고 비즈니스 기회를 찾는 것을 도와줍니다. mcp__yandex-search__search 등 Análisis competitivo de Yandex para identificar oportunidades en los mercados de búsqueda de Rusia y la CEI. Utiliza herramientas como mcp__yandex-search__search y mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests. Analyse concurrentielle Yandex pour identifier les opportunités sur les marchés de recherche russes et de la CEI. Utilisez des outils tels que mcp__yandex-search__search et mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests. Wettbewerbsanalyse von Yandex, um Chancen in den russischen und GUS-Suchmärkten zu identifizieren. Verwenden Sie Tools wie mcp__yandex-search__search und mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests. O Yandex Competitive Analysis é uma ferramenta para analisar concorrentes e encontrar oportunidades no mercado de busca russo e CIS. ИИ Агенты: Yandex Competitive Analysis - это инструмент для анализа конкурентов и нахождения возможностей на российском и СНГ рынках поиска. تحليل المنافس ياندكس هو أداة لتحليل المنافسين وfinding الفرص في السوق البحثية الروسية والسي آي إس how to use yandex-competitive-analysis yandex-competitive-analysis setup guide yandex-competitive-analysis alternative yandex-competitive-analysis vs ahrefs yandex-competitive-analysis install what is yandex-competitive-analysis yandex-competitive-analysis tutorial yandex-competitive-analysis for AI agents Yandex 竞争分析工具 俄罗斯搜索市场分析 CIS 搜索市场优化 AI 技术 mcp__yandex-search__search mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests Utilizes mcp__yandex-search__search to find current keyword rankings Leverages mcp__yandex-wordstat__top-requests to understand search volume and related queries Tracks competition over time with mcp__yandex-wordstat__dynamics Identifies underserved regional markets using mcp__yandex-wordstat__regions Analyzes popular queries with mcp__yandex-webmaster__get-popular-queries yandex-competitive-analysis is a skill that provides tools for analyzing competitors and finding opportunities in Russian and CIS search markets.');
