ew-change","openspec-new-change vs Marked 2","openspec-new-change setup guide","what is openspec-new-change","openspec-new-change alternative","openspec-new-change install","Markdown file preview","AsciiDoc file editing","VS Code extension for Marked 2"],"zh":["openspec-new-change","VS Code扩展","Markdown编辑","AsciiDoc编辑","artifact-driven","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion","AIエージェント","开发工具"],"ja":["openspec-new-change","VS Code拡張機能","Markdown編集","AsciiDoc編集","artifact-driven","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion","AIエージェント","開発ツール"],"ko":["openspec-new-change","VS Code 확장","Markdown 편집","AsciiDoc 편집","artifact-driven","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion","AI 에이전트","개발 도구"],"es":["openspec-new-change","VS Code","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Marked 2","agente de AI","herramienta de agente de AI","desarrollo de software","integración de herramientas"],"fr":["openspec-new-change","VS Code","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Marked 2","agent d''IA","outil d''agent d''IA","développement de logiciels","intégration d''outils"],"de":["openspec-new-change","VS Code","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Marked 2","KI-Agent","Tool für KI-Agents","Softwareentwicklung","Toolintegration"],"pt":["openspec-new-change","VS Code","Marked 2","arquivos Markdown","arquivos AsciiDoc","ferramentas de código","produtividade","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["openspec-new-change","VS Code","Marked 2","файлы Markdown","файлы AsciiDoc","инструменты кода","производительность","разработка программного обеспечения","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["openspec-new-change","VS Code","Marked 2","ملفات Markdown","ملفات AsciiDoc","أدوات الكود","الإنتاجية","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"gAmUssA","repo":"vscode-open-in-marked2","repoPath":"gAmUssA/vscode-open-in-marked2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.466Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-new-change","description":"Start a new OpenSpec change using the experimental artifact workflow. Use when the user wants to create a new feature, fix, or modification with a structured step-by-step approach.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Start a new change using the experimental artifact-driven approach.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentic","body":"Start a new change using the experimental artifact-driven approach.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentication\" → `add-user-auth`).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT proceed without understanding what the user wants to build.\n\n2. **Determine the workflow schema**\n\n   Use the default schema (omit `--schema`) unless the user explicitly requests a different workflow.\n\n   **Use a different schema only if the user mentions:**\n   - A specific schema name → use `--schema <name>`\n   - \"show workflows\" or \"what workflows\" → run `openspec schemas --json` and let them choose\n\n   **Otherwise**: Omit `--schema` to use the default.\n\n3. **Create the change directory**\n   ```bash\n   openspec new change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   Add `--schema <name>` only if the user requested a specific workflow.\n   This creates a scaffolded change at `openspec/changes/<name>/` with the selected schema.\n\n4. **Show the artifact status**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This shows which artifacts need to be created and which are ready (dependencies satisfied).\n\n5. **Get instructions for the first artifact**\n   The first artifact depends on the schema (e.g., `proposal` for spec-driven).\n   Check the status output to find the first artifact with status \"ready\".\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions <first-artifact-id> --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This outputs the template and context for creating the first artifact.\n\n6. **STOP and wait for user direction**\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter completing the steps, summarize:\n- Change name and location\n- Schema/workflow being used and its artifact sequence\n- Current status (0/N artifacts complete)\n- The template for the first artifact\n- Prompt: \"Ready to create the first artifact? Just describe what this change is about and I''ll draft it, or ask me to continue.\"\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Do NOT create any artifacts yet - just show the instructions\n- Do NOT advance beyond showing the first artifact template\n- If the name is invalid (not kebab-case), ask for a valid name\n- If a change with that name already exists, suggest continuing that change instead\n- Pass --schema if using a non-default workflow\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:09:26.145Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing streamlined Markdown and AsciiDoc file management with experimental artifact-driven approaches.","zh":"适合需要简化Markdown和AsciiDoc文件管理的开发者代理，采用实验性的基于构件的方法。","ja":"開発者エージェントがMarkdownとAsciiDocファイルの管理をストリームライン化する必要がある場合に適しています。実験的なアーティファクト駆動アプローチを使用します。","ko":"개발자 에이전트가 Markdown와 AsciiDoc 파일 관리를 간소화해야 하는 경우 적합합니다. 실험적인 아티팩트 주도 접근 방식을 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan una gestión de archivos Markdown y AsciiDoc simplificada con enfoques experimentales basados en artefactos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développeur ayant besoin d''une gestion de fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc simplifiée avec des approches expérimentales basées sur les artefacts.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickler-Agenten, die eine vereinfachte Verwaltung von Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateien mit experimentellen, artefaktbasierten Ansätzen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que necessitam de gerenciamento de arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc simplificado com abordagens experimentais baseadas em artefatos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков, которым необходим упрощенный менеджмент файлов Markdown и AsciiDoc с экспериментальными подходами, основанными на артефактах.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc المبسطة باستخدام مناهج تجريبية تعتمد على المكونات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to seamlessly open Markdown and AsciiDoc files in Marked 2, leveraging an experimental artifact-driven approach to initiate new changes, utilizing tools like the AskUserQuestion tool for open-ended user input and deriving kebab-case names from descriptive inputs.","zh":"赋予代理以无缝打开Marked 2中的Markdown和AsciiDoc文件的能力，利用实验性的基于构件的方法来启动新的更改，使用AskUserQuestion工具等来获取开放式用户输入，并从描述性输入中推导出烤串式名称。","ja":"Marked 2でMarkdownとAsciiDocファイルを開くことができるエージェントをEmpowerし、実験的なアーティファクト駆動アプローチを使用して新しい変更を開始し、AskUserQuestionツールなどのオープンエンドユーザー入力を利用し、記述的な入力からケバブケース名を導き出します。","ko":"Marked 2에서 Markdown와 AsciiDoc 파일을 열 수 있는 에이전트를赋予权限하고, 실험적인 아티팩트 주도 접근 방식을 사용하여 새로운 변경을 시작하며, AskUserQuestion 툴 등을 사용하여 개방형 사용자 입력을 수신하고, 설명적인 입력에서 케밥 케이스 이름을 도출한다.","es":"Permite a los agentes abrir de forma transparente archivos Markdown y AsciiDoc en Marked 2, aprovechando un enfoque experimental basado en artefactos para iniciar nuevos cambios, utilizando herramientas como la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la entrada de usuario de preguntas abiertas y derivando nombres en kebab-case a partir de descripciones de entrada.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''ouvrir de manière transparente des fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc dans Marked 2, en exploitant une approche expérimentale basée sur les artefacts pour initier de nouveaux changements, en utilisant des outils comme l''outil AskUserQuestion pour la saisie utilisateur à questions ouvertes et en dérivant des noms en kebab-case à partir d''entrées descriptives.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateien in Marked 2 nahtlos zu öffnen, indem es einen experimentellen, artefaktbasierten Ansatz nutzt, um neue Änderungen zu initiieren, unter Nutzung von Tools wie dem AskUserQuestion-Tool für offene Benutzereingaben und Ableitung von kebab-case-Namen aus beschreibenden Eingaben.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a abrir arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc em Marked 2 de forma transparente, utilizando uma abordagem experimental baseada em artefatos para iniciar novas alterações, utilizando ferramentas como a AskUserQuestion para entrada de usuário aberta e derivando nomes em kebab-case a partir de entradas descritivas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью бесшовно открывать файлы Markdown и AsciiDoc в Marked 2, используя экспериментальный подход, основанный на артефактах, для инициации новых изменений, используя инструменты, такие как AskUserQuestion, для открытого ввода пользователя и получая имена в kebab-case из описательных входных данных.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فتح ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc في Marked 2 بطريقة متكاملة، باستخدام منهج تجريبي يعتمد على المكونات لبدء تغييرات جديدة، باستخدام أدوات مثل AskUserQuestion لمدخلات المستخدم المفتوحة واستنتاج أسماء kebab-case من المدخلات الوصفية."},"useCases":{"en":["Initiating new changes with descriptive user inputs","Automating Markdown and AsciiDoc file openings in Marked 2","Deriving kebab-case names for changes from user descriptions"],"zh":["使用描述性用户输入启动新的更改","在Marked 2中自动打开Markdown和AsciiDoc文件","从用户描述中推导出更改的烤串式名称"],"ja":["記述的なユーザー入力を使用して新しい変更を開始する","Marked 2でMarkdownとAsciiDocファイルを開くことを自動化する","ユーザーの説明から変更のケバブケース名を導き出す"],"ko":["설명적인 사용자 입력을 사용하여 새로운 변경을 시작하는 것","Marked 2에서 Markdown와 AsciiDoc 파일을 자동으로 여는 것","사용자 설명에서 변경의 케밥 케이스 이름을 도출하는 것"],"es":["Iniciar nuevos cambios con entradas de usuario descriptivas","Automatizar la apertura de archivos Markdown y AsciiDoc en Marked 2","Derivar nombres en kebab-case para cambios a partir de descripciones de usuario"],"fr":["Initier de nouveaux changements avec des entrées utilisateur descriptives","Automatiser l''ouverture de fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc dans Marked 2","Dériver des noms en kebab-case pour les changements à partir de descriptions utilisateur"],"de":["Neue Änderungen mit beschreibenden Benutzereingaben initiieren","Automatisierung der Öffnung von Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateien in Marked 2","Ableitung von kebab-case-Namen für Änderungen aus Benutzerbeschreibungen"],"pt":["Iniciar novas alterações com entradas de usuário descritivas","Automatizar a abertura de arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc em Marked 2","Derivar nomes em kebab-case para alterações a partir de descrições de usuário"],"ru":["Инициировать новые изменения с описательными входными данными пользователя","Автоматизировать открытие файлов Markdown и AsciiDoc в Marked 2","Получать имена в kebab-case для изменений из описательных входных данных пользователя"],"ar":["بدء تغييرات جديدة مع مدخلات مستخدم وصفية","تأتمتة فتح ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc في Marked 2","استنتاج أسماء kebab-case للتعديلات من مدخلات المستخدم الوصفية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires VS Code extension installation","Limited to Markdown and AsciiDoc file formats","Experimental artifact-driven approach may require additional configuration"],"zh":["需要安装VS Code扩展","仅限Markdown和AsciiDoc文件格式","实验性的基于构件的方法可能需要额外的配置"],"ja":["VS Code拡張機能のインストールが必要","MarkdownとAsciiDocファイル形式のみ","実験的なアーティファクト駆動アプローチには追加の設定が必要"],"ko":["VS Code 확장 프로그램 설치가 필요하다","Markdown와 AsciiDoc 파일 형식만 해당된다","실험적인 아티팩트 주도 접근 방식은 추가적인 구성이 필요할 수 있다"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la extensión de VS Code","Limitado a formatos de archivo Markdown y AsciiDoc","El enfoque experimental basado en artefactos puede requerir configuración adicional"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de l''extension VS Code","Limité aux formats de fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc","L''approche expérimentale basée sur les artefacts peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation der VS Code-Erweiterung","Begrenzt auf Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateiformate","Der experimentelle, artefaktbasierte Ansatz kann eine zusätzliche Konfiguration erfordern"],"pt":["Requer instalação de extensão do VS Code","Limitado a formatos de arquivo Markdown e AsciiDoc","Abordagem experimental baseada em artefatos pode requerer configuração adicional"],"ru":["Требуется установка расширения VS Code","Ограничен форматами файлов Markdown и AsciiDoc","Экспериментальный подход, основанный на артефактах, может потребовать дополнительной настройки"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت ملحقات VS Code","محدود بالتنسيقات ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc","المنهج التجريبي الذي يعتمد على المكونات قد يتطلب تكوينًا إضافيًا"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"2325ae1019930c6383abd2f1312a8aa41600ac8893d036f3da74530b43df9352","qualityScore":50}');
