INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('gAmUssA/vscode-open-in-marked2/openspec-new-change', 'openspec-new-change', 'gAmUssA', 'vscode-open-in-marked2', 'community', 'openspec-new-change gAmUssA vscode-open-in-marked2 community The openspec-new-change skill is a VS Code extension that opens Markdown and AsciiDoc files in Marked 2, benefiting developers who work with these file formats. It uses an experimental artifact-driven approach to start new changes. openspec-new-change是一款VS Code扩展，用于打开和编辑Markdown和AsciiDoc文件，支持实验性的artifact-driven方法 openspec-new-changeは、MarkdownとAsciiDocファイルを開き編集するためのVS Code拡張機能で、実験的なartifact-drivenアプローチをサポートしています openspec-new-change는 Markdown와 AsciiDoc 파일을 열고 편집하기 위한 VS Code 확장으로, 실험적인 artifact-driven 방법을 지원합니다 El complemento openspec-new-change para VS Code permite abrir archivos Markdown y AsciiDoc en Marked 2. Utiliza la aproximación experimental basada en artefactos. L''extension openspec-new-change pour VS Code permet d''ouvrir des fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc dans Marked 2. Elle utilise l''approche expérimentale basée sur les artefacts. Die Erweiterung openspec-new-change für VS Code ermöglicht das Öffnen von Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateien in Marked 2. Sie verwendet den experimentellen Ansatz basierend auf Artefakten. O openspec-new-change é uma extensão do VS Code que permite abrir arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc no Marked 2. Ele utiliza uma abordagem experimental baseada em artefatos para iniciar uma nova alteração. openspec-new-change - это расширение VS Code, которое позволяет открывать файлы Markdown и AsciiDoc в Marked 2. Оно использует экспериментальный подход, основанный на артефактах, для начала новой изменений. openspec-new-change هو امتداد لبرنامج VS Code يسمح بفتح ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc في Marked 2. إنه يستخدم نهج تجريبي قائم على المكونات لبدء تغيير جديد how to use openspec-new-change openspec-new-change vs Marked 2 openspec-new-change setup guide what is openspec-new-change openspec-new-change alternative openspec-new-change install Markdown file preview AsciiDoc file editing VS Code extension for Marked 2 openspec-new-change VS Code扩展 Markdown编辑 AsciiDoc编辑 artifact-driven kebab-case AskUserQuestion AIエージェント 开发工具 Opens Markdown files in Marked 2 for preview and editing Supports AsciiDoc files for enhanced documentation capabilities Utilizes an experimental artifact-driven approach for starting new changes Derives kebab-case names from user descriptions for change tracking Employs the AskUserQuestion tool for clarifying user requests Allows users to describe what they want to build or fix for new changes openspec-new-change is a VS Code extension that facilitates opening Markdown and AsciiDoc files in Marked 2, utilizing an artifact-driven approach for new changes.');
